<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Makonde Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malove lambone lamwâmba Yesu Kilisto lalembwîje na Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yohana</para>
  <para style="mt2">Malove lambone lamwâmba Yesu Kilisto lalembwîje na</para>
  <para style="mt">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongoledi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu achino cha Malove Lambone lamwâmba Yesu Kilisto lalembwîje na Yohana, nni chitabu chimo mmitabu ncheche vya Lilailano lya Hambi vitânga maisha langa Yesu Kilisto. Kila chitabu mmitabu anevyo ncheche chìchemwa “Injili” mana lake, “Malove Lambone lamwâmba Yesu.” Vitabu anevyo vílembwije bada ya kuhwa kwanga Yesu. Vanalembile vitabu anevyo nni Matayo na Mako na Luka na Yohana. Chitabu cha Yohana chílembwije mmwaka fulani, pepi na mmwaka wa 90 kutandikila mwaka wavelekwejije Yesu Kilisto. Ikànava chitabu achino chikáhaula kuva Yohana njo achilembîle, henga namuna ya ilembi yake ìlandana namene na ilembi aila ilembwîje m'baluwa inandi ya Yohana na baluwa yavili ya Yohana na baluwa yatatu ya Yohana. Vakúlemba vanji va kala vànnyaula Yohana kuva, mmahiku anelo áikala muimanga ya ku Efeso. Bahi ing'anya ya anelyo, ìnahululika kuva chitabu achino chílembwije muimanga ya Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana 20:31, Yohana àhaula chihi mwandu kuva, makudungilo la chitabu achino nni kuvayangata vanu vapate kukulupila kuva, Yesu njo Kilisto, Mwana wa Nnungu, na kwa kunkulupila vapate umi kupitila kulundana nawe. Chitabu achino chílembwije kwajili ya vakúsoma va Chiyahudi na avala vakávele Vayahudi. Chitabu cha Yohana chikálandana namene na vitabu vinji vya Injili. Yohana ànihimya namene kuyamba àlalá masaibu lalatendìlè Yesu, na akálembile namene kuyamba mifano yanahumije Yesu. Na habali dinji dya muhimu, diyâmba kubatiswa na kulingwa kwake akula kulilanga, nalanang'o nanga palalembwije nchitabu achino chilembwije na Yohana.</para>
  <para style="iot">Uinjipihi wa chitabu cha Yohana</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1:1-18, Yohana àtandiliha chitabu chake kwa kulonjelela kuva, Yesu nni lilove lya Nnungu.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 1:19-12:50, Yohana àlemba kuyamba masaibu fulani lalatendìlè Yesu.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Sula ya 13:1-20:31, Yohana àtana kuyamba mambo lohe lanahumidile mmaisha langa Yesu, panavele mmwanda wa kukuhwa na kufufuka kwake. Na Yohana 20:31, Yohana àmalilila kwa kutanga likudungilo lyake lya kulemba chitabu achino.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Sula ya 21, Yohana àmalilila chitabu kwa kutanga kuyamba uhiku aula Yesu wanavahumidile vanu bada ya kufufuka kwake.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Lilove nkujuka munu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Anepo patandi, chilambo kabla chikànambiumbwa, Lilove ávele apwawììje, na Lilove ávele pamo na Nnungu. Malinga chanavele Nnungu na Lilove ávele uchocho. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Kutandikila anepo patandi aneyo Lilove ávele pamo na Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Vitukutuku vyammalele víumbwije kupitila nang'e, na wala nanga chinu chimo chinaumbwije bila nang'e. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Nang'e ávele chitandikilo cha umi na umi anewo úvele nng'anje kwa vanu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Nng'anje anewo ùlangaja nnupi, na lupi nanga palunahulwile kuudimanga nng'anje.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Pávele na munu yumo anatumwije na Nnungu, lina lyake Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Nang'e áidile unavahaulila vanu kuyamba aneyo nng'anje, uchinga kwa malove lake, vanu vammalele vapate kukulupila. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Yohana mwene akánavele aneyo nng'anje, henga áidile chihi unavahaulila vanu uhiu wa habali dya aneyo ánavele nng'anje. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Ayuno njo nng'anje uhiu uîda apano pachilambo, uvalangajîja vanu vammalele.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Aneyo nng'anje ánipwawa pachilambo, na kupitila nang'e chilambo chíniumbwa, henga vanu va pachilambo nanga pavanammaite kuva nang'e ni nnani. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Nang'e áidile kwa vanu vake, henga vanu vake nanga pavanampwecheledile. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Henga avala vammalele vampwecheledîle na kunkulupila, àvatendile vajuke kuva vana vanga Nnungu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Apano Yohana àlembile “vakulupîla mulina lyake.” Kwa vanu va mahiku anelo aneyo yavele itangodi ya kawaida kuhaula kuva, munu àtenda chinu mulina lya nkulu fulani. Na ívele na mana kuva ànilundana na aneyo nkulu na àtenda mambo kwa niaba yake na kwa mamulaka lake. Bahi kukulupila mulina lyake ìvele na mana ya kunkulupila mwene, na akee chihi kulikulupila lina.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Vana anevo vakávele vana vanga Nnungu kwa kuvelekwa muchi chivavelekwa vanu, na wala nanga pavavelekwejije malinga chutamwa mmili, na wala akee malinga chatamwa munu, henga kwa kutamwa kwa mwene Nnungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Lilove nkujuka munu, nkuikala pamo na hwetu, akuno aombèèle inema na uhiu. Na hwetu tùniwona ukulu wake, ukulu wanga Mwana wa weka ahalêke kwa Atata Nnungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yohana Nkúbatisa pammwene Yesu, nkuvahaulila vanu habali dyanga munu aneyo, wanonoha lidi wachidoni, “Ayuno njo unichimwamba panichihaula kuva, ‘Aîda nnyuma mwangu nni nkulu kungupunda nangu kwa kuva, nang'e ánipwawa kabla nangu nikànambivelekwa.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Ing'anya ya ukulungwa wa chididi chake ànitubaliki na kutubaliki. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Nnungu áhumije Sheliya yake kupitila Musa, henga Yesu Kilisto áidile na chididi na kuuhunukula uhiu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Nanga munu awahîte kumwona Nnungu. Henga Mwana wa weka wa Nnungu, nang'e njo Nnungu muhiu, avêle pamo na Atata Nnungu, aneyo njo atumaihîje chavele Atata Nnungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyang'ula kwanga Yohana Nkúbatisa kuva nang'e akee Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mako 1:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Auno njo ushahidi wanga Yohana Nkúbatisa wakati Vakulu va Vayahudi va ku Yelusalemu pavanavatumile makuhani na Valawi vahwene vakammuje Yohana kuva nang'e nni nnani. <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Yohana akanahitile kuvayang'ula, nkuvahaulila chihi bila kuvapiha kuchidoni, “Nangu nikávele Kilisto alolêwa kwida.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Vanang'o nkummuja kavila kuchidoni, “Hambi wako nnani? Dachi, wako njo Eliya?” Yohana nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu nikávele Eliya.” Nkummuja kavila kuchidoni, “Dachi, wako njo ayula nabii?” Yohana nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nanga.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Vanang'o nkummuja kavila kuchidoni, “Vino wako nnani? Tuhaulile, wako umwene ùlitanga dachi uchinga tukavahaulile avala vatulaijîje tukakuuje?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Yohana nkuvayang'ula kwa malove langa nabii Isaya wachidoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“Nangu njo mwene lidi lipilikanîka kulilanga ulichidoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Nyoshanga indila ya Nang'olo.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Anevo vanu vanalaijijwe na Mafalisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>nkummuja kavila Yohana kuchidoni, “Ikàva wako ùhaula kuva ukávele Kilisto, na ukávele Eliya, na wala ukávele ayula nabii, hambi mwadachi ùnabatisa?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yohana nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Lola, nangu nìm'batisa mwenu kwa medi, henga pàvele munu yumo mmwenu umukammaite. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Nang'e njo ayula ungunannyawile kuva, àvenkwida nnyuma mwangu, na nangu wala nikáfala kuntumikila kananga kwa kuhungula mididi ya vilatu vyake.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Vitukutuku anevyo vítendeke aneko ku Besaniya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Besaniya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Chijiji achino cha Besaniya chitambulengwe apano akee achila chivachiikala vanga Lasalo na Maliya. </char></note>, kung'ambo muto wa Yoludani, pachinu pachivabatisa vanu Yohana.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 1:28">Ungandolo wamwana wa Nnungu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:28">
    <figure style="fig" alt="John the baptist 2 men and Jesus - WA03813" file="JohnTheBaptist2Men&amp;Jesus_John1.35-36_WA03813.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="1:28"/> <verse eid="JHN 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Liduva lipapête Yohana nkumwona Yesu wahaloka, Yohana nkuvahaulila vanu kuchidoni, “Nnole ungandolo wamwana wa Nnungu avausîja masambi vanu va pachilambo! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Ayu njo unichimwamba panichihaula kuchidoni, ‘Nnyuma mwangu àvenkwida munu nkulu ungupunda nangu, kwa kuva nang'e ánipwawa kabla nangu nikànambivelekwa!’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Nangu nimwene nikanammaite kuva nnani, henga ngùidile unabatisa vanu kwa medi uchinga amaikane kwa vanu va Isilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Anepo Yohana nkuhumya ushahidi wachidoni, “Nímmwene Umumu Wanaswe achionekâna muchi umunda wasulupuka kuhaloka kulihunde, nkutulila muha mwake. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Nangu nikánammale kuva nang'e nnani, bila ayula angutumîle unabatisa vanu kwa medi unguhaulila anepo patandi kuva, ‘Aneyo umbemwôna Umumu Wanaswe wansulupukila, na kutulila muha mwake, aneyo njo abatîsa kwa Umumu Wanaswe.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Nangu nimwene ńnivyona vitukutuku anevyo, na mbènkushuhudila kuva, ayu nni Mwana wa Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vakuhundwa vatandi vanga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Liduva lipapête, Yohana ávele pamo na vakuhundwa vake vavili. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Yohana pammwene Yesu wapita, nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Nnolange ungandolo wamwana wa Nnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Avala vakuhundwa vavili vanga Yohana pavapilikene malove anelo, nkumpapata Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yesu nkulauka, nkuvona vakuhundwa uvammpapata, Yesu nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Mùtaha chamani?” Vanang'o nkuyang'ula kuchidoni, “Labi ùikala kwachi?” Labi mana lake Nkúhunda. <verse eid="JHN 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Idang'ana mupone.” Bahi avala vakuhundwa nkumpapata, nkupona pachinu páikàlà, nkuikala nawe liduva alila lyammalele. Na uhiku anewo wávele malinga sakumi chinalyulo.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Anduleya nnung'une Simoni Petulo ávele yumo wa avala vakuhundwa vavili vanampilikene Yohana pachitangola malove àlalá, nkunnondola Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Chinu chitandi chatendile Anduleya, ni kuntaha Simoni nkuluwe nahoti, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Tùnimwona Masiya,” yani Kilisto.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vayahudi válolela kumpwechela mpohi kuhaloka kwa Nnungu. Mpohi aneyo kwa Chieblaniya vánchema “Masiya,” na kwa Chigiliki vánchema “Kilisto,” mana lake, atandolwejîje na Nnungu.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Anepo Anduleya nkumpelekeja Simoni kwanga Yesu. Yesu nkunnola Simoni, nkuchidoni, “Wako nni Simoni mwana wanga Yohana, henga hambi ùmbechemwa Kefa.” Kefa nni lina linji lyanga Petulo, Petulo mana lake, “liyanga.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu ànchema Filipo na Nasanieli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Philip calling Nathanael - CN01664" file="PhilipCallingNathanael_John1.45_CN01664.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="1:42"/> <verse eid="JHN 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Liduva lipapête, Yesu ákudungidile kuhwena ku Galilaya. Bahi nkumwona Filipo, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Ngupapate.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Filipo áhaleke ku Betisaida, imanga yachiikala Anduleya na Petulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Filipo nanang'e nkukojana na Nasanieli, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Tùnimwona ayula uvannembile mmitabu vya Sheliya yanga Musa na mmitabu vya manabii, Yesu wa ku Nasaleti, mwana wanga Yusufu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Nasanieli nkummuja Filipo kuchidoni, “Ìmbehululika dachi chinu chambone chihaloke ku Nasaleti?” Filipo nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Ida ulilolee umwene.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Yesu pammwene Nasanieli wahaloka, nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Lolanga! Ayu nni Mwisilaeli muhiu, wala kulambila kukapali nkati mwake.” <verse eid="JHN 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Nasanieli nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Wako ùngumaite dachi nangu?” Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Apala punavele pahi nnandi wa vihepo vya tini, Filipo akànakuchema, nangu nanikwona.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Anepo Nasanieli nkuchidoni, “Nkúhunda, wako nni Mwana wanga Nnungu, wako njo Nfalume wa Isilaeli.” <verse eid="JHN 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila Filipo kuchidoni, “Dachi, wako ùningukulupila ing'anya nìkuhaulidile kuva nanikwona uikèlè pannandi? Nìkuhaulila kuva, uchiuvyone vitukutuku vikulu kupunda avi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila kavila Nasanieli kuchidoni, “Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, muchimukwone kulihunde ukuhunukuka na malaika uvakwela na kusulupuka muha mwanga Mwana wa Munu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuing'ole ya ulombi aneko Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Bada ya maduva mavili, nkuva na ing'ole ya ulombi aneko kuimanga ya Kana, chilambo cha ku Galilaya, na anyokwe Yesu ávele ukoko. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Yesu pamo na vakuhundwa vake navanang'o vánikumbulwa kuing'ole aneyo. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Padimalilike divayi divanaandee paing'ole, anyokwe Yesu nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Divayi dìnivahilila.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Mama, yetuhwe ilida? Uhiku wangu bado ukánambikamola.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Anyokwe Yesu nkuvahaulila vatumishi kuchidoni, “Lyohelyo lyambennyaulila mukole, mwenu likole.” <figure style="fig" alt="Water into wine - WA03814" file="WaterIntoWine(WeddingInCana)_John2.1-12_WA03814.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="2:5"/><verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Na pachinu anepo pávele na vilongo vikulu sita vikatapajîjwe kwa mayanga, kila chilongo chénda milengelo mivili au mitatu ya medi. Vilongo anevyo vívele apala kupapatana na nnyambo wa Vayahudi wa kulihahula. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila avala vatumishi kuchidoni, “Umbajanga medi vilongo vyammalele.” Vanang'o nkwombajanga, toopu. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Anepo Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Hambi tekanga mukamwing'e nkwímilila ing'ole.” Vanang'o nkuteka, nkumpelekejija. <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Nkwímilila ing'ole nkuyeja adila divayi dínavele medi anepo patandi. Nang'e nanga panamaite kudihaleke adila divayi, henga avala vatumishi vanatekile medi vánimala. Nkwímilila ing'ole nkunchema nnombi, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Vanu vammalele vàtandilika kuveng'a vakumbuliwîje divayi dinôwa nahoti, na vakàkalewa nkwida na divayi dikánowa. Henga wako mpaka vino uvechinkukondya divayi dinôwa namene kupunda dyammalele.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Achino nni chimaiho chitandi cha lisaibu, chanatendile Yesu kuimanga ya Kana, chilambo cha ku Galilaya. Bahi Yesu nkulanguja ukulu wake na vakuhundwa vake nkunkulupila.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Pavaukile apala, Yesu na anyokwe na anung'unuvake pamo na vakuhundwa vake nkuhelela kuhweneng'ana ku Kapelinaumu, aneko nkuikala maduva kadiki.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 2:12">Yesu pa Ing'ande ya Nnungu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 2:12">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matayo 21:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mako 11:15-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 2:12">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus driving merchants from temple - Dunham DN00429" file="JesusDrivingMerchantsFromTemple_DN00429.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="2:12"/> <verse eid="JHN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Sikukuu ya Vayahudi ichêmwa Pasaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pasaka yavele Sikukuu ya Chiyahudi kukumbukila uhiku aula Nnungu pavapohije Vaisilaeli kuhaloka muutumwa nchilambo cha Misili, mmahiku àlalá langa Musa. Nnungu ántumile Malaika Nkúwalala uchinga akahukùùmù n'ding'ande dyammalele dya ku Misili, na kila ing'ande inapakwîjwe myadi ya ungandolo munnango, vánipohwa kuhaloka muhukumu ya Nnungu. </char></note> painavele pepi, Yesu nkuyamboka kuhwena ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Painjidile nnuwani lwa Ing'ande ya Nnungu, nkuvakoja vanu vohe uvasumisa ding'ombe, na vanji uvasumisa dingandolo na vanji uvasumisa dimunda. Na vanu vanji vachibadilana dihela navanang'o vávele umwomwo vaikalèngè n'dimeza dyavo. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Bahi Yesu nkupota n'didi, nkujuha isimbo nkuvavingangila pawelu vanu vammalele pamo na dingandolo na ang'ombe vao. Anepo nkudibinula dimeza dya akúbadili dihela na dihela dyavo dya nnyoyo nkumwadilikana. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Nkuvahaulila avala vachisumisa dimunda kuchidoni, “Usang'anya vitukutuku vyenu apano. Ing'ande ya Atatangu munaijuhe kuva ing'ande ya kusumisija vitukutuku!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Vakuhundwa vake nkulahimukila malove lalembwîje Mmalemba Lanaswe làhaula kuva, “Itamwi iniitamwa ing'ande yako ìmbengutenda nguwalalwe.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Bahi vakulu va Vayahudi nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Ùmbetenda chimaiho ntwani cha lisaibu kumaiha kuva ùnilembelewa utenda vitukutuku avino?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Iyondongange Ing'ande aino ya Nnungu, nanani nguchiniidenge mmaduva matatu.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Vayahudi nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Ing'ande aino ya Nnungu ídengwile kwa vyaka alubaini na sita. Wako ùmbehulula dachi kuidenga mmaduva matatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Henga Ing'ande ya Nnungu yachiiyamba Yesu úvele mmili wake. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Bahi Yesu pafufuliwije, vakuhundwa vake nkuhimukila kuva ánitangola anelo. Nkulakulupila Malemba Lanaswe na malove àlalá lanatangwele Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ànimala chiivele mitima ya vanu vammalele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Uhiku aula Yesu pánavele ku Yelusalemu kusikukuu ya Pasaka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Pasaka, lola Yohana 2:13.</char></note> vanu vohe vánivyona vimaiho vya masaibu vyatendile, bahi nkunkulupila. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Henga Yesu nanga panalilekeledile kwa vanu anevo ing'anya ániimala mitima yavo. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Nang'e nanga panalembedile vanu vannyaulile chinu chohecho chimwâmba munu yunji, kwa kuva mwene ánimala lavêle mmitima ya vanu vammalele.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nawi Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus with Nicodemus - CN01670" file="JesusWithNicodemus_John3.1-2_CN01670.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="3:0"/> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Pávele na munu yumo lina lyake Nikodemo, wa nnikuwa lya vakulu va lukumbi lwa Vayahudi, ánavele nnikuwa lya chidini lya chiyahudi lichichêmwa Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Aneyo munu nkummwenela Yesu nachilo, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nkúhunda, hwetu tùnimala kuva wako ùlaijijwe na Nnungu, kwa kuva nanga munu ahulûla kutenda chimaiho cha lisaibu malinga chutenda wako, ikànave chihi Nnungu àvele pamo na wako.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu nìkuhaulila uhiu kuva, nanga munu ambehulûla kuinjila mu Ufalume wa Nnungu akànavelekwe mwanda wavili.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nikodemo nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Ìmbehululika dachi munu nkulungwa avelekwe mwanda wavili? Àmbehulula dachi kwenda nnitumbo lya anyokwe nkuvelekwa mwanda wavili?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu nìkuhaulila uhiu kuva, munu akànavelekwe kwa medi na kwa Umumu Wanaswe, akambeinjila mu Ufalume wa Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Munu àvelekwa chimmili kuhaloka kwa atatake na anyokwe, henga imumu ìvelekwa kuhaloka kwa Umumu Wanaswe. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Bahi unakangane ing'anya inguhawile kuva mùlembelewa muvelekwe mwanda wavili. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Mpapa ùnapunga kuhwena kuulembela, na unaupilikana lidi lyake, henga ukámala kuuhaloka wala kuuhwena. Uvila nni chiikamajanga kuhauliha namuna chavelekwa munu kwa Umumu Wanaswe.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nikodemo nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Vitukutuku avino vìhululika dachi?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Wako nni nkúhunda wa Vaisilaeli, ìvadachi unalamale alano? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Nangu nìkuhaulila uhiu kuva, hwetu tùhaula malove latulamaite na kushuhudila àlalá latulawene, henga mwenu nkatamwanga kupwechelela ushahidi wetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Nangu nìnnyaulidile vitukutuku vya pachilambo, henga nkángukulupidile, mùmbengukulupila dachi panimbennyaulila vitukutuku vya kulihunde? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Nanga munu woheyo apîte kulihunde, ikànave chihi Mwana wa Munu ahalêke kulihunde. <figure style="fig" alt="Bronze snake and Moses" file="cn01671c.TIF" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="3:13"/><verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Malinga Musa chanannyanywile nnyongo anakatapajijwe kwa shaba, nkumpatika muha luhichi akula kulilanga, nni uchocho chalembelewa Mwana wa Munu kunyanyuliwa muha, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>uchinga munu woheyo ambenkulupîla ààve na umi ukee na ntululilo. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Kwa kuva, Nnungu ánivatamwa namene vanu va pachilambo, nkunnyumya Mwanawe wa weka uchinga kila munu ambenkulupîla anahwe, henga ààve na umi ukee na ntululilo. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Nnungu akanantumile Mwanawe pachilambo uchinga avahukumu vanu, henga ánintuma uchinga avapohe.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Munu woheyo ankulupîla Mwana wa Nnungu akambehukumiwa, henga ayula akánkulupila, tayali ànihukumiwa, ing'anya akánkulupidile Mwana wa weka wa Nnungu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba lina lola Yohana 1:12.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Na hukumu aneyo ìhalokana na alano, nng'anje ùniida pachilambo, henga vanu nkulutamwa namene lupi kupunda nng'anje, kwa kuva, lávatendàngà lànihakalanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Kila munu atênda lakánkatapalila Nnungu ànauchima nng'anje, na akátamwa kwida kunng'anje, wayopa lànapihuliwa àlalá lakánkatapalila Nnungu latênda. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Na munu atênda lalalembela Nnungu, nang'e àida kunng'anje, uchinga àlalá latênda lamaike kuva Nnungu nni antendîle alatende anelo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malove langa Yohana Nkúbatisa lamwâmba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Bada ya anelo, Yesu pamo na vakuhundwa vake nkuhwena chilambo cha ku Yudeya. Nkuikala aneko akuno wavabatisa vanu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Yohana nanang'e ávele aneko ku Ainoni pepi na ku Salemu, wabatisa vanu, ing'anya aneko kúvele medi lohe, na vanu nkummwenela, nanang'e nkuvabatisa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Na maduva anelo Yohana ávele bado akànambitaywa nnilungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Bahi vakuhundwa vanga Yohana na Nnyahudi yumo vánatahukana kuyamba mihambo yavo ya kulihahula. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Bahi avala vakuhundwa nkummwenela Yohana nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nkúhunda, ayula munu únavenawe pamo kung'ambo muto wa Yoludani na kutanga habali dyake, hambi nanang'e àvenkubatisa, na vanu vohe namene vànammwenela.” <verse eid="JHN 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yohana nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Munu akáhulula kuva na chinu chohecho ikànave chihi achila chahumije Nnungu kuhaloka muha kulihunde. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Mwenu mmene mùnahulula chihi kushuhudila kuva naninnyaulila kuva, ‘Nangu nikee Kilisto, henga ǹnilaijwa uchinga ninnongolelee!’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Nang'e nni malinga nnombi na nangu nni malinga nnyanjawake nnombi. Nnyanjawake nnombi ànaimila wanninda nnombi akamole, nang'e ànahangalala akàpilikana lidi lya nnombi pakamola. Uchocho nni nangu chinguhangalala namene kupilikana anelo lamunguhaulidile. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Ìlembelewa nang'e ààve nkulu, na nangu ngùlembelewa ngùùve nin'joko.<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Aneyo ahalôka kulihunde nni nkulu kupunda vitukutuku vyammalele, na munu wa pachilambo asili yake nni pachilambo na àtangola chihi vitukutuku vya pachilambo. Henga aneyo ahalôka kulihunde nni nkulu kupunda vitukutuku vyammalele. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Na àtangola àlalá lalawene na kulapilikana, henga nanga munu alakulupîla malove lake. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Na kila munu apwechelêla malove lake, nang'e ànamaiha kuva Nnungu nni uhiu. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Ayula atumwîjwe na Nnungu, àtangola malove la Nnungu, ing'anya Nnungu àmwing'ile Umumu wake bila chipimo. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Atata Nnungu ànantamwa Mwanawe, bahi àvikile vitukutuku vyammalele mmakono lake. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Munu woheyo ankulupîla Mwanawe, nang'e ààva na umi ukee na ntululilo. Na ayula akánkulupila Mwanawe, akambekuva na umi ukee na ntululilo, na gasabu ya Nnungu ìmbemwikalila.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mmahe wa Chisamaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Mafalisayo nkupilikana kuva Yesu àvatenda vanu vohe namene kuva vakuhundwa na kuvabatisa, kumpunda Yohana Nkúbatisa. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Yesu mwene nanga panam'batisije munu, henga vakuhundwa vake nni vachibatisa. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Bahi Yesu pamaite anelo, nkuuka chilambo cha ku Yudeya nkuhwena kavila chilambo cha ku Galilaya, <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>na mwanda anewo álembelewa apitììle chilambo cha ku Samaliya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Anepo Yesu nkuhwika imanga imo ya chilambo cha ku Samaliya ichêmwa Sikali, imanga ínavele pepi na welu wanga Yusufu wanauhumije atatake uvanchema Yakobo anepo kala. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Pachinu apala pávele na chihima cha Yakobo. Yávele malinga uhiku wa sasita ya muhi. Kwa kuva, Yesu ánihopela na mwanda, nkuikala nnyenje chihima.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Anepo nkuida mmahe yumo Nsamaliya unateka medi. Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Mbayele medi la kukumbila.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Uhiku anewo vakuhundwa vake vápite kumanga unasùmà chakulya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:8">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Samaritan woman at well - DN00433" file="SamaritanWomanAtWell_John4.1-42_DN00433.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="4:8"/> <verse eid="JHN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Henga ayula mmahe nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Wako Unnyahudi na nangu Nsamaliya! Ùmbenguyuwa dachi medi na nangu ngùvele Nsamaliya?” Átangwele uchocho ing'anya Vasamaliya na Vayahudi vakáchikundanika. <verse eid="JHN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Kuikavele umàlà inujo yahumya Nnungu, na nnani akuhaulîla kuva mbayele medi la kukumbila, wako ukaninnyuwa nang'e, nanang'e akanikwing'a medi lahûmya umi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Ayula mmahe nkuchidoni, “Nang'olo, wako ukee na mpowola, na chihima chìnilepa, dachi ùmbepata kwachi medi lahûmya umi? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Anakulwetu Yakobo nni atwing'île hwetu chihima achino, ata mwene Yakobo pamo na vana vake na vannyama vake vammalele vákumbila medi la chihima uchino. Dachi, wako ùlilambilila kuva nkulu kumpunda anakulwetu Yakobo?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Kila munu akumbîla medi la chihima achino, àmbekuva na inyota kavila. <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Henga munu woheyo ambekumbîla medi lanimbemwing'a nangu, akambekuva na inyota kavila. Medi lanimbemwing'a nangu làmbekuva muchi chimbwimbwi chikulûla medi lahûmya umi ukee na ntululilo nkati mwake.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Ayula mmahe nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, mbayele nangu anelo medi uchinga nnave na inyota kavila na wala nnaide kavila apano unateka medi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Hwena ukancheme ntwalo koka uide nawe apano.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Ayula mmahe nkunnyang'ula Yesu kuchidoni, “Nangu nikee na ntwangu.” Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Ùyangw'ile saana, kuva ukee na ntwalo. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Kwa kuva, úlombwije na valume nnyano na aneyo uikalâna nawe vino akee ntwalo halali, anepo ùtangwele uhiu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Ayula mmahe nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, nangu ngwòna wako nni nabii. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Anakuluvetu Vachisamaliya vánnyuwa Nnungu nnichinga alino, henga mwenu Mmayahudi mùhaula kuva, pa Yelusalemu nni pachinu pakunnyuwila Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Mama, ngukulupile, kùmbekuva na mahiku lamukambennyuwa Atata nnichinga alino wala kananga aneko ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Mwenu Mmasamaliya, mukámmaite umunnyuwa, henga hwetu tuvayahudi tùnnyuwa utummaite, kwa kuva upohi wa Nnungu ùmbekwida kupitila kwa Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Henga mahiku làvenkwida, na hambi lànikamola, avala vamwabûdu Nnungu kwa uhiu, pavambemwabudu Atata kwa kulojwa na Umumu Wanaswe na uhiu. Kwa kuva, Atata àvalembela vanu vamwabûdu namuna aneyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Nnungu nni imumu, na avala vamwabûdu vàlembelewa vamwabùùdu kwa kulojwa na Umumu Wanaswe na uhiu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Ayula mmahe nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Nangu ǹnimala kuva, àvenkwida Masiya, yani Kilisto.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Masiya na Kilisto lola Yohana 1:41.</char></note> Na pambekwida àmbetuhaulila kila chinu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nangu ngulonjêla na wako, ‘Nangu nni Unene.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa kutangola malove alano “Nangu nni Unene,” Yesu ànalitambulanga kwa kutumila lina lyanatumidile Nnungu kulitambulanga nchitabu cha Kuuka 3:14. </char></note>”<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Anepo vakuhundwa vake nkuuyananga, pavammwene Yesu walonjela na ayula mmahe nkukangana namene. Henga nanga munu anammujije kuva, “Ùlembela chamani kwanga aneyo mmahe?” au, “Mwadachi ùlonjela na ayu mmahe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:27">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Samaritan woman calling friends - CN01675" file="SamaritanWomanCallingFriends_John4.28-29_CN01675.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="4:27"/> <verse eid="JHN 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Bahi ayula mmahe nkuleka nnengelo wake wa medi, nkuhwena kumanga na kuvahaulila vanu kuchidoni, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>“Tuhweneng'ane mukannole munu anguhaulidîle nangu lammalele langútendîle! Dachi, ìnahululika kuva nang'e njo Kilisto?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Bahi vanu va imanga aila nkuukananga, nkummwenela Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Uhiku uwowo vakuhundwa vake nkuva uvannyuwa Yesu uvachidoni, “Chonde Nkúhunda, ilya chakulya.” <verse eid="JHN 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Henga Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu ngùvele na chakulya chimukamaite mwenu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Bahi vakuhundwa vake nkuva uvaujana kuchidoni, “Dachi, pàvele munu ampelekejîje chakulya?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Chakulya changu nni kulatenda àlalá lalalembela ayula angutumîle na kulamalila madengo lake. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Mwenu mùnijevelela kuhaula kuchidoni, ‘Ìisalidile chihi myedi ncheche ukamole nchela!’ Henga nangu nìnnyaulila kuva, valolange ava vanu, vàvele muchi vilyo mmwelu, vilyo vilembelêwa vifunwe hambi. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Nkúfuna àpwechelela nshahala wake, na vilyo vyafuna nni vanu vaidanavo muumi ukee na ntululilo, uchinga ayula apânda na ayula afûna vammalele vahangalale pamo. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Kwa kuva, itangodi aino nni ihiu kuva, ‘Munu yumo ànapanda na munu yunji ànafuna.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Nangu nìntumile mwenu mukafune vilyo vimukatendedile madengo la kulima, vanji nni vatendîle madengo la kukamajanga, henga mwenu mùpita chihi mmadengo lavatendile avenu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Vasamaliya vohe va imanga aila nkunkulupila Yesu ing'anya ya malove lanatongwele ayula mmahe kuva, “Àninguhaulila lammalele langutendenge.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Vasamaliya vánimmwenela Yesu nkunnyuwa aikale navo, nkwikala aneko kumanga maduva mavili. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Na vanu vohe namene váninkulupila Yesu ing'anya ya malove lake mwene. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Vanang'o nkunnyaulila ayula mmahe kuchidoni, “Hambi tùnikulupila akee chihi ing'anya ya malove lako, henga hwetu tuvene tùnipilikana na kumala kuva muhiu ayu nni Mpohi wa vanu va pachilambo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ànnamya mwana wanga nkulu yumo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Bada ya maduva mavili, Yesu nkuuka anepo nkuhwena chilambo cha ku Galilaya, chilambo chavelekwejije. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Yesu mwene áhawile kuchidoni, “Nabii nanga paesimika nkaya yake.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Henga pakamwele ku Galilaya, vanu vohe va aneko, nkumpwechelela, ing'anya vanang'o vánilona lammalele lanatendile Yesu chipindi cha sikukuu ya Vayahudi ichêmwa Pasaka aneko ku Yelusalemu, kwa kuva na vanang'o vávelenge ukokwo.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Bahi Yesu pachipita nchilambo cha Galilaya, nkuhwika kavila muimanga ya Kana, pachinu panapindikulanyije medi kuva divayi. Na aneko ku Kapelinaumu kúvele na nkulu yumo wa ufalume wa Loma ánavele na mwana achiuula. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Ayula nkulu papilikene kuva Yesu ànikamola aneko ku Galilaya kuhaloka ya kuchilambo cha ku Yudeya, nkummwenela nkunnyuwa ahwene ku Kapelinaumu akannamye mwanawe achiuula namene, kwa kuva ávele pepi na kuhwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila ayula nkulu kuchidoni, “Mwenu mmanu mukànavyone vimaiho vya masaibu na lakukanganya, mwiko nkambehulula kukulupila!” <verse eid="JHN 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Ayula nkulu nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, nakuyuwa, tuhwene kukaya kabla mwanangu akànambikuhwa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila ayula nkulu kuchidoni, “Wako hwena chihi mwanalo mumi.” Ayula munu nkùkulupila malove lavannyaulidile na Yesu, nkupindikuka uhwena ya kwavo. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Pánavele nndila wahwena ya kwavo, nkukojana na vatumishi vake, nkunnyaulila kuva, mwanawe mumi. <verse eid="JHN 4:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Anepo ayula nkulu nkuvauja disaa dyalamile mwanawe. Vanang'o nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nang'e àlamile lido sasaba ya muhi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Ayula nkulu nkuhimukila kuva, dívele disaa udila dyanannyaulidile Yesu kuva, “Mwanalo mumi.” Bahi nang'e pamo na vanu vammalele va nng'ande mwake nkunkulupila Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Auno wávele mwanda wavili, Yesu kuhaloka ku Yudeya nkuhwena ku Galilaya, na kutenda chimaiho cha lisaibu.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ànnamya munu palitanda lya medi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Paralyzed man at pool - WA03828" file="ParalyzedManAtPool_John5.3-7_WA03828.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="5:0"/> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Bada ya anelo, Yesu nkuhwena ku Yelusalemu kusikukuu ya Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Aneko ku Yelusalemu, pepi na nnango wa imanga uchêmwa, “Nnango wa Angandolo,” pávele na litanda lijoko lya medi lichêmwa kwa Chieblaniya “Betisata,” na litanda anelyo lívele na dimenu nnyano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3-4"/>N'dimenu anedyo múvele na vagonjo vohe vachilalanga, vaputêle meho na vikwavi na vadidimênge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3-4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mmalemba matandi-matandi, malove la ntululilo la nsitali wa 3 na malove lammalele la nsitali wa 4, lakapali. Henga mmalemba lanji lakávele matandi-matandi làlembwije malove lahaûla kuva, “Vanu anevo válindilila medi latibuliwe. Kwa kuva, myanda yohe malaika ánakamola nnitanda anelyo watibulanya medi. Na n'gonjo woheyo áchiva ntandi kwenda nnitanda anelyo, medi palatibuliwa ánalama ugonjo wake.” </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Pachinu anepo pávele munu yumo achihuvanga kwa chipindi cha myaka salasini na nane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Yesu pammwene ayula munu alêle apala na kumala kuva àlele apala kwa mahiku lohe, nkummuja kuchidoni, “Dachi, ùnalembela kulama?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Ayula munu nkunnyang'ula Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, nangu nikee na munu wa kunguinjija nnitanda palatibuliwa medi. Na kila pangulinga kwenda mmedi, munu yunji ànangulongolelela.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila ayula munu kuchidoni, “Imila, utwale chinanda chako, uhwene.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Upala ayula munu nkulama, nkutwala chinanda chake, nkutandilika kuhwena. Na liduva anelyo lívele Liduva lya Kuyewelela. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Bahi Vayahudi nkunnyaulila ayula munu alamîjwe kuchidoni, “Nelo nni Liduva lya Kuyewelela, wako ukáluhusiwa kunyakula nkeka wako.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Nang'e nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Ayula munu angulamîje nni anguhaulidîle kuva, ‘Twala nkeka wako uhwene.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Vanang'o nkummuja kuchidoni, “Aneyo munu akuhaulidîle kuva, ‘Twala nkeka wako uhwene,’ nnani?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Ayula munu nanga pannammaite munu annamîje, kwa kuva, Yesu ávele atividììle nnikuwa likulu lya vanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Anepo Yesu nkunkoja ayula munu alamîjwe avèlè nnuwani lwa Ing'ande ya Nnungu, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Lola, wako vino ùnilama. Bahi unauyile kavila kutenda masambi, uchinga lanakukoje la kuhakalanga namene kupunda alano.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Ayula munu nkuhwena kwa vakulu va Vayahudi, nkuvahaulila kuva, Yesu nni annamîje.<verse eid="JHN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Kwa kuva, Yesu ánnamije ayula munu Liduva lya Kuyewelela, bahi Vayahudi nkulindamuka kunkambyakambya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Henga Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Atatangu àvele chihi nkukola madengo mpaka nelo, nanani uchocho mbènkukola madengo.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Malove anelo lanatangwele Yesu lavatendile Vayahudi kukudungila namene kummwalala Yesu, akee chihi ing'anya ya kutenda lakáluhusiwa Nniduva lya Kuyewelela, ila na kwa kunchema Nnungu kuva Atatake, nang'e àlilinganyanga na Nnungu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mamulaka langa Yesu, Mwana wa Nnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Bahi Yesu nkuhweneha kuvahaulila Vayahudi kuchidoni, “Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, Mwana wa Nnungu akáhulula kutenda chitukutuku chohecho kwa ding'ano dyake mwene, henga àtenda chihi achila chamwona Atatake watenda. Ing'anya, achila chàchitenda Atatake nanang'e àchitenda uchila. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Kwa kuva, Atata ànantamwa Mwanawe, na àninnanguja kila chinu chachitênda mwene. Na achiannanguje mambo makulu kupunda alano uchinga mwenu mukangane. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Kwa kuva, malinga Atata chavafufula vanu vahwîle na kuveng'a umi, nni uchocho Mwanawe chaveng'a umi avala vávalembêla. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Atata akánnyukumu munu woheyo, henga hukumu yammalele ànkamujije Mwanawe, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>uchinga vanu vammalele vamwesììmù Mwanawe, malinga chivamweshimu Atata. Na munu akámweshimu Mwanawe, akámweshimu na Atata antumîle.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, ayula apilikâna lilove lyangu na kunkulupila ayula angutumîle, ànipata umi ukee na ntululilo. Nang'e akambehukumiwa asabu, kwa kuva, ìmbekuva ànihama mukuhwa, nkwenda muumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, pàmbekuva na uhiku, na uhiku anewo ùnikamola, vanu vahwîle uvambelipilikana lidi lya Mwana wa Nnungu, na vanu vambelipilikâna, vàmbekuva vumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Malinga Atata chavele na umi nkati mwake, nni uchocho chantendile Mwanawe kuva chitandikilo cha umi. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Na àmpele mamulaka la kuhukumu, ing'anya nang'e nni Mwana wanga Munu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Mwenu munakangane malove anelo, ing'anya pàmbekuva na liduva, vanu vammalele vahwîle livambelipilikana lidi lyake, <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>na vanang'o vàmbehuma mmisati yavo. Avala vatendîle lambone vàmbefufuka na kupata umi, henga avala vatendîle lahakalenge vàmbefufuka uchinga vahukumiwe asabu.”<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ushahidi unnyâmba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>“Nangu nikáhulula kutenda chinu chohecho kwa ding'ano dyangu nimwene. Nangu ngùhukumu chihi malinga chingupilikana kuhaloka kwa Atata, na hukumu yangu ni ya haki, kwa kuva nangu nikákudungila chihi kutenda chingulembela nangu nimwene, henga kutenda chalembela ayula angutumîle. <verse eid="JHN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>Nangu nikàlishuhudila nimwene, ushahidi anewo ukambekubaliwa kuva wa uhiu. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Henga pàvele na munu yunji angushuhudîla nangu, na aneyo nni Yohana, na nangu nnìmala kuva ushahidi wake kwamba nangu ni wauhiu. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Mwenu mwavatumile vanu kwa Yohana Nkúbatisa, nang'e nkuushuhudila chihi uhiu kungwamba nangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Nangu nikálisingila ushahidi wa vanu, henga ngùtangola malove alano uchinga mupate kupohwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yohana ávele muchi chibatali chichiyaka na kulangaja, na mwenu múnitandola kuuhangalalila nng'anje wake kwa chipindi. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Henga nangu ngùvele na ushahidi nkulu namene kupunda aula wahumije Yohana Nkúbatisa. Kwa kuva, mambo langútèndà vino njo lánguhaulidìlè Atata nilatende, nalanang'o nni langushuhudîla na kulanguja kuva nang'e àningutuma. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Atata angutumîle nanang'e uchocho ànangushuhudila. Mwenu mukanawahi kupilikana lidi lyake wala kumwona chavele. <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>Na malove lake lakáikala mmitima mwenu, kwa kuva nanga pamungukulupila nangu wangutumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Mwenu mùloleha Malemba Lanaswe umutenda kuva nkati mwake mùmbepata umi ukee na ntululilo. Malemba anelo njo lángushuhudìlà nangu, <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>henga mwenu nkátamwanga kwida kwang'une uchinga mupate umi.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>Nangu nikákudungidile kupata imbili kuhaloka kwa vanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Nangu ǹnimmala kuva mwenu nanga pamuntamwa Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Lola! Nangu ǹniida kwa mamulaka la Atatangu, henga nkángupwecheledile, ila munu yunji akàida kwa mamulaka lake mwene, mwenu muchimumpwechele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba lina, lola Yohana 1:12.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Bahi ikàva mwenu mùtaha kupwechela imbili kuhaloka kwenu mmene na akee kuhaloka kwanga Nnungu wa weka, hambi mùmbehulula dachi kukulupila? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Mwenu munatende kuva nangu nìmbensitaki kwa Atatangu. Ambensitâki mwenu nni Musa umunnolela kuva àmbekuva m'bali wenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Mukàchinkulupila Musa, nkaningukulupila na nangu mwalehu, kwa kuva Musa ánilemba habali dinguyâmba nangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Henga ikàva nanga pamulakulupila àlalá lalémbîle Musa, mùmbehulula dachi kukulupila malove lángutangòlà?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu àveng'a chakulya vanu alufu nnyano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mako 6:30-44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Bada ya anelo, Yesu nkuyamboka Litanda lya Galilaya, yani Litanda lya Tibeliya. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Likuwa likulu lya vanu nkumpapata Yesu, ing'anya vanu anevo váviwene vimaiho vya masaibu vyachivitenda kwa kuvalamya vagonjo. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Yesu nkukwela nnichinga, nkuikala aneko pamo na vakuhundwa vake. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Na Sikukuu ya Vayahudi ichêmwa Pasaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Pasaka, lola Yohana 2:13.</char></note> ívele pepi kukamola. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Bahi Yesu palolite na kulyona likuwa likulu lya vanu ulihaloka, nkummuja Filipo kuchidoni, “Tukasume kwachi mikate uchinga ava vanu valye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Yesu átangwele uchocho wanninga chihi Filipo, kwa kuva mwene ánimala lyambelitenda. <verse eid="JHN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filipo nkunnyang'ula Yesu kuchidoni, “Ata kututumila dihela malinga dya nshahala wa malipo la maduva myambili kusuma mikate, ikambeoneleja kananga kumupa kila munu chipande chijoko!” <verse eid="JHN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Nkúhundwa yumo wa Yesu uvannchema Anduleya, nnung'une Simoni uvanchema Petulo, nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Apano pàvele kijana yumo avêle na mikate nnyano ya shayili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shayili ni dimbeyu dilandâna na utani, na nkate ukatapajîjwe na shayili nanga pauchigalika.</char></note> na dihomba dimbili. Dachi, vitukutuku avino vìmbetoleja chani kwa vanu vohe malinga ava?” <figure style="fig" alt="Loaves &amp; Fish - HK00155" file="Loaves&amp;Fish_HK00155.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="6:9"/><verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Vahaulile vanu vaikalange pahi.” Pachinu anepo pávele na wahi wohe, bahi vanu nkuikalanga, na isabu ya valume weka vánavele anepo yávele malinga alufu nnyano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Yesu nkuitwala aila mikate, nkunshukulu Nnungu na kuvayavanyija vanu vammalele vanaikalenge apala, na dihomba na dinang'o nkutenda uchocho. Na kila munu nkùpata malinga chanalembedile. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Vammalele pavasibile, Yesu nkuvahaulila vakuhundwa vake kuchidoni, “Lokotanga vibeduli vyammalele viisalidîle vya mikate, uchinga vitumike kavila.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Bahi vakuhundwa nkulokotanya maisalilo la vibeduli vya mikate, nkwombaja makalala kumi na mbili. <figure style="fig" alt="Feeding the 5000 - WA03856" file="FeedingThe5000(4000)-5CollectingLeftovers_WA03856.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="6:13"/><verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Vanu pavachiwene achila chimaiho cha lisaibu chatendile Yesu, nkuchidoni, “Muhiu ayu munu nni ayula nabii utuchinnolela kwida pachilambo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Yesu pamaite kuva vámbeida unantwala kwa dimongo uchinga vankan'juhe kuva nfalume, nang'e nkuuka nkuhwena kavila kulichinga weka.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 6:15">Yesu àonga muha medi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 6:15">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mako 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 6:15">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus walking on water - CN01720" file="JesusWalkingOnWater_CN01720.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="6:15"/> <verse eid="JHN 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Pachikamwele chinalyulo, vakuhundwa va Yesu nkuhelelekela ya kulitanda. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Nkukwelanga muingalava, nkutandilika kuyomboka litanda kuhwena kuimanga ya Kapelinaumu. Chipindi anecho lupi lúvele lwendìlè, na Yesu ávele bado akànambivakoja. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Lipungo likulu nkutandilika kupunga namene na litanda nkutibuka mawimbi. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Bahi pavapite mwanda wa kilometa malinga nnyano au sita, nkumwona Yesu avèlè pepi na ingalava, waonga muha medi, vakuhundwa vake nkuyopa namene. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Henga Yesu nkuvahaulila vakuhundwa vake kuchidoni, “Ni nangu, munayope!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Bahi vakuhundwa vake kwa kuhangalala, nkumpwechelela Yesu muingalava, upala ingalava nkuhwika kunnyangi, pachinu pavachihwena.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu vàntaha Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Ulyamba wake, likuwa lya vanu vanaisalidile m'bali wavili wa litanda, vánikameka kuva pachinu anepo ípwawije chihi ingalava imo bahi. Na vánimala kuva Yesu akanainjidile muingalava aila pamo na vakuhundwa vake, ila vakuhundwa vake vápite chihi vanang'o weka. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Na dingalava dinji nkukamola kuhaloka kuimanga ya Tibeliya, nkuhwika pachinu apala pavanalile vanu aila mikate, bada ya Nang'olo Yesu kunshukulu Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Bahi avala vanu pavamaite kuva Yesu na vakuhundwa vake vakapali pachinu apala, nkukwelanga n'dingalava dyavo nkuhwena kuimanga ya Kapelinaumu unantaha Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu njo nkate úvatèndà vanu vààve na umi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Avala vanu pavankojije Yesu ng'ambo ya vili ya litanda, nkummuja kuchidoni, “Nkúhunda, wako ùkamwele chakani apano?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, mwenu mùngutaha nangu ing'anya ya aila mikate imunalile na kusiba, henga akee ing'anya ya kwelewa mana ya avila vimaiho vya masaibu vingunatendile. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Munatumbamile kupata chakulya chondongeka, ila tumbamila kupata chakulya chikóndongeka na chiîda na umi ukee na ntululilo. Na Mwana wa Munu njo ambemwîng'a mwenu chakulya anecho, kwa kuva nang'e njo walimaihijije Atata Nnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Vanang'o nkummuja kuchidoni, “Hwetu tutende dachi uchinga tukole madengo lalalembela Nnungu?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Madengo lalalembela Nnungu mulatende nni alano, munkulupile chihi ayula wantumile.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Avala vanu nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Dachi, wako ùmbelanguja chimaiho ntwani cha lisaibu, uchinga tuchone na tupate kukukulupila? Dachi, ùmbetenda chinu ntwani? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Aneko kulilanga akuluvetu válile chakulya chichêmwa ‘Mana,’ chakulya chilandêne na nkate, malinga chiilembwije Mmalemba Lanaswe kuva, ‘Ávalisije nkate uhalêke kulihunde.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, Musa nanga panampele mwenu nkate uhalôka kulihunde, henga Atatangu nni amwîng'a mwenu nkate uhiu uhalôka kulihunde. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Kwa kuva, nkate wauhumya Nnungu nni ayula asulupûka kuhaloka kulihunde, na nni avêng'a vanu va pachilambo umi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Avala vanu nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, hwetu tùnakuyuwa utwing'e nkate anewo maduva lammalele.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nangu njo nkate wene uvatênda vanu vààve na umi. Aîda kwang'une akambekuva na indala mwiko, na angukulupîla nangu akambekuva na inyota mwiko. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Henga nangu naninnyaulilanga mwenu kuva, ikànava mùningwona, wala nanga pamungukulupila. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Vanu vammalele vánìng'à Atata vàmbeida kwang'une, na ayula aîda kwang'une mwiko nikambemminganga. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Kwa kuva, nangu ǹnisulupuka kuhaloka kulihunde uchinga ngutende àlalá lalalembela ayula angutumîle, akee unatenda langúlembèlà nangu nimwene. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Lalalembela ngulatende ayula angutumîle nni alano, avala vanu vángupèlè nnannyahe kananga yumo, henga nivafufule vammalele nniduva lya ntululilo wa chilambo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Kwa kuva, chalembela Atatangu nni achino, kila munu ambemwôna Mwana wa Nnungu na kunkulupila ààve na umi ukee na ntululilo, na nangu nguchininfufule munu aneyo nniduva lya ntululilo wa chilambo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Bahi Vayahudi pavapilikene uchocho nkutandilika kuhinginika ing'anya Yesu áhawile kuva, “Nangu njo nkate usulupwîke kuhaloka kulihunde.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Vanang'o nkuva uvatangola kuchidoni, “Kwani ayu tenda Yesu mwana wa Yusufu? Atatake na anyokwe hwetu tùnivamala! Vino nang'e àhulula dachi kuhaula kuva, ‘Ǹnisulupuka kuhaloka kulihunde?’ ” <verse eid="JHN 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Lekanga kuhinginikilanila mmene kwa mmene. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Nanga munu àhulula kwida kwang'une akanachemwe na Atatangu angutumîle, na nangu nguchininfufule munu aneyo liduva lya ntululilo wa chilambo. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Mmalemba la manabii ìlembwije kuva, ‘Vanu vammalele vàmbehundwa na Nnungu.’ Kila munu ampilikâna Atatangu na kulihunda kuhaloka kwanga nang'e, aneyo àida kwang'une. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Aino ikee na mana kuva ànipwawa munu awahîte kumwona Atata, ikànave chihi nangu nguhalêke kwa Nnungu, nangu njo nimmwêne Atata. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, munu woheyo akulupîla àpata umi ukee na ntululilo. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Nangu njo nkate uvatênda vanu vààve na umi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Aneko kulilanga anakuluvenu vánilya nkate<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Apano Yohana àlembile Mana, na aneyo mana yalandene na nkate, njo mana Yesu àlilonjeledile mwene kuva nang'e nni nkate usulupwîke kuhaloka kulihunde.</char></note> uhalêke kulihunde, henga vánihwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Henga nangu njo nkate usulupûka kuhaloka kulihunde, uchinga munu woheyo ambeûlya anahwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Nangu njo nkate uvatênda vanu vààve na umi, nkate usulupwîke kuhaloka kulihunde. Munu woheyo akàulya nkate auno, àmbekuva na umi ukee na ntululilo. Na nkate auno ni mmili wangu, unimbeuhumya kwajili ya vanu va pachilambo uchinga vapate umi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Bahi Vayahudi pavapilikene uchocho nkutandilika kutahukana vene kwa vene uvachidoni, “Munu ayu àmbehulula dachi kutwing'a mmili wake tuulye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, mwenu nkanaulye mmili wanga Mwana wa Munu na kukumbila myadi yake, bahi nkambekuva na umi nkati mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Na munu woheyo aûlya mmili wangu na kukumbila myadi yangu, ààva na umi ukee na ntululilo, na nangu nguchininfufule munu aneyo nniduva lya ntululilo wa chilambo. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Kwa kuva, mmili wangu nni chakulya cha uhiu, na myadi yangu nni chikumbilo cha uhiu. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Munu woheyo aûlya mmili wangu na kukumbila myadi yangu, aneyo ànakumilana na nangu na nangu nakumilana na aneyo munu. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Malinga Atata angutumîle chavele na umi, na nangu ngùùva na umi ing'anya yanga nang'e, uchocho munu woheyo angûlya nangu àmbekuva na umi ing'anya yang'une. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Bahi auno nni nkate usulupwîke kuhaloka kulihunde, henga ukee muchi chakulya chichêmwa ‘Mana’ inasulupwike kuhaloka kulihunde, ivachilya anakuluvenu akula kulilanga. Pamo na kulya Mana aneyo, vammalele vánihwanga, henga munu ambeûlya nkate auno àmbekuva na umi ukee na ntululilo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Yesu átangwele malove anelo pánavele nkùhunda muing'ande ya kunnyuwila Nnungu, aneko ku Kapelinaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malove lavêle na umi ukee na ntululilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Bahi vanu vohe muavala vakuhundwa vake pavapilikene uchocho, nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Malove ala lànikamajanga! Munu ntwani ambehulûla kulapwechela?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Yesu nkumala kuva vakuhundwa vake vànahinginika ing'anya ya malove anelo, nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Dachi, malove alano lànanchima? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Bahi ìmbekuva dachi pamumbemwona Mwana wa Munu wakwela kavila kulihunde, pachinu panavele mwanda ntandi? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Umumu Wanaswe nni avêng'a vanu umi, vanu nanga pavahulula kutenda uchocho. Na malove laninnyaulidile mwenu nni la Umumu Wanaswe, na làvele na umi. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Henga pàvele vanu vanji mmwenu vakákulupila.” Na Yesu átangwele uchocho kwa kuva ánivamala chítandilìkè vanu avala vakambenkulupila na ayula ambentengelêka. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Yesu nkuhweneha kuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Njo mana nangu nínnyaulidile kuva, nanga munu àhulula kwida kwang'une bila kuhululihwa na Atatangu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Ing'anya ya malove anelo, vanu vohe vachinkulupîla nkunnekanga, na nanga pavanannondwele kavila Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Anepo Yesu nkuvauja avala vakuhundwa kumi na mbili kuchidoni, “Dachi, na mwenu uchocho ǹnembeukananga?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Petulo nkunnyang'ula Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, hwetu tùmbehwena kwakinani? Wako nni uvêle na malove lavêng'a vanu umi ukee na ntululilo. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Hwetu tùnimala na kukulupila kuva wako nni ayula Wanaswe ahalêke kwa Nnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Dachi, nangu nikee nintandwêle mwenu kumi na mbili? Henga yumo mmwenu àlojwa na Ibilisi!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Yesu átangwele malove anelo wamwamba Yuda mwana wanga Simoni Isikaliote, kwa kuva nang'e nni ambentengelêka ikànava ávele yumo wa avala kumi na mbili.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na anung'unuvake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Bada ya anelo, Yesu nkupita waonga nchilambo cha ku Galilaya. Akanatamwije kwonga chilambo cha ku Yudeya, ing'anya vakulu va Vayahudi vákudungidile kummwalala. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Bahi Sikukuu ya Vayahudi ichêmwa, Sikukuu ya Migongwe, yávele pepi kukamola, <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>bahi anung'unuvake Yesu nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Uka apano uhwene ya ku Yudeya, uchinga vakuhundwa vako vakalone lutenda. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Munu alembêla amaikane, akátenda vitukutuku vyake kwa sili. Bahi ikàva ùtenda vitukutuku avi, bahi lilanguje kwa vanu va pachilambo.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Ata anung'unuvake Yesu navanang'o nanga pavanankulupidile. <verse eid="JHN 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Uhiku wangu ulembelêwa, ukánambikamola. Henga kwenu mwenu kila uhiku ùnafala. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Vanu va pachilambo vakáhulula kummenga mwenu, henga vànguvenga nangu ing'anya nangu nashuhudila kuva, lavatendanga lànihakalanga. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Mwenu hweneng'ana kusikukuu aneyo. Henga nangu nikambekwida kusikukuu aneyo, kwa kuva uhiku ukatapêle kwang'une ukánambikamola.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Yesu patangwele malove anelo, nkuisalila chihi nchilambo uchila cha ku Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu àhwena ku Yelusalemu ku Sikukuu ya Migongwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Anung'unuvake pavaukile uhwena ya kusikukuu, Yesu nanang'e nkuhwena, henga ápite chihi kwa sili bila kulilanguja kwa vanu. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Aneko kusikukuu, vakulu va Vayahudi nkuva uvantaha Yesu akuno uvaujana kuchidoni, “Kwani ayu munu àvele kwachi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Mmakuwa àlalá la vanu múvele na manyinyi lachinnyamba Yesu. Vanu vanji váhaula kuchidoni, “Yesu nni munu wambone.” Na vanu vanji váhaula kuva, “Yesu akávele munu wambone! Nang'e àvalambila chihi vanu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Henga nanga munu analingile kutangola habali dyanga Yesu palangele, kwa kuva vávayopa vakulu va Vayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Bahi paihwikile ching'ati sikukuu, Yesu nkuinjila nnuwani lwa Ing'ande yanga Nnungu nkutandilika kuhunda. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Anepo Vayahudi pavapilikene mahundo lake, nkukangana namene uvachidoni, “Munu ayu àipete dachi elimu malinga ayi akuno akasomìlè?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Mahundo lánguhûnda nangu lakávele langu, ila ni la ayula angutumîle. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Munu woheyo akàlembela kutenda lalalembela Nnungu, achiamale kuva mahundo langu làhaleke kwanga Nnungu, au ngùtangola chihi kwa ding'ano dyangu nimwene. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Munu atangôla chihi kwa ding'ano dyake mwene, aneyo àtaha chihi imbili yake mwene. Henga munu ayula atâha imbili ya ayula antumîle, aneyo nni wa kukulupika, na wala nanga palambila. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Dachi, Musa akanampele mwenu Sheliya? Henga wala nanga munu yumo mmwenu aikamûla Sheliya aneyo. Ing'anya ntwani mùlembela munguwalale?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Bahi avala vanu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Wako ùvele na nanndenga! Nnani akudungidîle ukuwalala?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu ngútendile lisaibu limo, na mwenu mmammalele mmenkuhemwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Mwenu mùvayalula vanu ata Liduva lya Kuyewelela ing'anya Musa ámpele mwenu amuli ya kuyalula. Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, amuli aneyo ikanahaleke kwanga Musa, ila íhaleke kwa anakuluvenu. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Bahi ikàva mùnahulula kunnyalula munu Liduva lya Kuyewelela uchinga Sheliya yanga Musa inalumulwe, mwadachi mùnguvisija nangu ing'anya ya kunnamya munu Liduva lya Kuyewelela? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Lekanga kuhukumu kwa kupamipamila, henga ìlembelewa muhukumu kwa haki.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dachi, Yesu njo Kilisto?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Kilisto, lola Yohana 1:41.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Bahi vanu vanji va ku Yelusalemu nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Dachi, ayu munu akee uvantaha uchinga vammwalale? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Hambi lola, àtangola chihi palikuwa lya vanu na wala nanga munu annyaulîla lilove lyohelyo! Dachi, ìnahululika kuva vakulu navanang'o vànimala kuva, muhiu ayuno njo Kilisto? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Henga kwahaloka ayu munu hwetu tùnikumala. Na Kilisto pambeida nanga munu ambemâla pachinu páhalèkè!”<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Bahi Yesu pánavele nnuwani lwa Ing'ande yanga Nnungu wahunda, nkunonoha lidi nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Mwenu mùningumala, na kunguhaleke mùnikumala! Nangu nìkaidile kwa mamulaka langu nimwene, henga ayula angutumîle nni wauhiu, na mwenu nanga pamummaite. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Henga nangu ǹnimmala, kwa kuva ngùhaleke kwanga nang'e, nanang'e nni angutumîle nangu.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Anepo vanu nkulembela vankamule Yesu, henga nanga munu analingile kunkamula, kwa kuva uhiku wake wa kukamulwa wávele ukànambikamola. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Vanu vohe nnikuwa lya vanu vánavele apala, nkunkulupila Yesu, nkuva uvahaula kuchidoni, “Pámbeìdà Kilisto tuchitummale, kwa kuva àmbetenda masaibu lohe. Na ayu munu àtenda masaibu lohe, bahi ìnahululika kuva ayu njo Kilisto.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:31">
    <figure style="fig" alt="High priest ordering guards - CN01737" file="HighPriestOrderingGuards_CN01737.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="7:31"/> <verse eid="JHN 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Mafalisayo nkupilikana malove lavachitangola vanu kumwamba Yesu. Bahi makuhani vakulu na Mafalisayo nkuvatuma valinzi vakankamule Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yesu nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Nangu nìmbekuva pamo na mwenu kwa mahiku kadiki, koka nguhwene kwanga ayula angutumîle. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Mùmbengutaha, henga nkambengwona, kwa kuva pachinu panimbekuva mwenu nkambehulula kuhwika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Vakulu va Vayahudi nkutandilika kuujana vene kwa vene, uvachidoni, “Ayu munu àmbehwena kwachi kutukambehulula kumwona? Dachi, àmbehwena kwa Vayahudi vamwadilikêne mmilambo vya vanu vakávele Vayahudi, akavahunde vanu vakávele Vayahudi? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Àvele na mana ntwani páhaùlà kuva, ‘Mùmbengutaha, henga nanga pamumbengwona, na pachinu panimbekuva nangu, mwenu nanga pamumbehulula kuhwika?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Liduva lya ntululilo lya sikukuu aneyo, liduva lîva likulu namene musikukuu aneyo, Yesu nkuimila nkunonoha lidi wachidoni, “Munu woheyo avêle na inyota aide kwang'une akumbile. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Malinga Malemba Lanaswe chilahaula kuva, munu woheyo angukulupîla nangu, myuto ya medi lavêng'a vanu umi dìmbekulula kuhaloka muntima mwake!” <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Yesu átangwele malove anelo wamwamba Umumu Wanaswe kuva, avala vankulupidîle nang'e vachivampwechelele. Mahiku anelo, Umumu Wanaswe ávele akànambikamola, kwa kuva Yesu ávele akànambikwinjila muukulu wake.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Vanu vanji nnikuwa alila pavapilikene malove anelo nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Muhiu, ayuno munu nni nabii achilolêwa kwida!” <verse eid="JHN 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Vanu vanji nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Ayuno nni Kilisto!” Henga vanu vanji nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Nanga, ìmbehululika dachi Kilisto ahaloke ku Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Dachi, Malemba Lanaswe lakáhawile kuva, Kilisto àmbevelekwa muudukulu wa Nfalume Daudi, muimanga ya Beselehemu, imanga yavelekwejije Daudi?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Bahi vanu vánavele apala palikuwa nkutandilika kuyavanyika ing'anya ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Vanu vanji nkulembela vankamule Yesu, henga nanga analingile kunkamula.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vakulu va Vayahudi vakánkulupila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Bahi avala valinzi pavauyang'ene, makuhani vakulu na Mafalisayo, nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Ing'anya ntwani mukáidinawe?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Valinzi nkuyang'ula kuchidoni, “Hwetu tukánambimwona munu atangôla muchi chatangola ayula munu!” <verse eid="JHN 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Bahi Mafalisayo nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Dachi, na mwenu uchocho mùnikumbika? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Dachi, alida muvakulu vetu au Mmafalisayo ankulupidîle nang'e? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Henga likuwa alino lya vanu vakaimaîte Sheliya ya Musa vànilaniwa na Nnungu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Nfalisayo yumo uvanchema Nikodemo, anammwenedile Yesu nachilo, nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>“Dachi, Sheliya yetu ìnatuluhusu kunnyukumu munu kabla tukànambimpilikanila hoti na kumala chatendile?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Vanang'o nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Dachi, na wako uchocho ùhaleke ku Galilaya? Bahi hwena ukatahe Mmalemba Lanaswe, uchiulole kuva nabii akambehaloka ku Galilaya!”<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Bahi nkuukananga, kila munu nkuhwena kukaya kwake.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Mmahe uvankamwile ugoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:53-8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mmalemba la kala namene, misitali ya 7:53-8:11 ikapali.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Yesu nkuhwena ku Lichinga lya Miseituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Bahi liduva lipapete, ulyamba na mambumbu Yesu nkuhwena kavila nnuwani lwa Ing'ande yanga Nnungu. Vanu vammalele nkummwenela, nang'e nkuikala, nkutandilika kuvahunda. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Vakúhunda Sheliya yanga Musa na Mafalisayo, nkumpelekejija Yesu mmahe yumo uvankamwile ugoni, nkumwimija muyo mwa vanu vammalele. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Bahi nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Nkúhunda, ayuno mmahe vànkamwile ugoni. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Mu Sheliya yetu, Musa ánituamulisa kuva, nkongwe malinga ayu apanywe mayanga, mpaka ahwe. Hambi wako wàmba dachi?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Avala vanu vátangwele malove anelo uvanninga chihi Yesu, uchinga vapate ing'anya ya kunsitaki. Henga Yesu nkutepa na kulemba muulongo kwa chala chake. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Pavahalijije kummuja, Yesu nkuhinamuka, nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Munu woheyo akávele na sambi nnikuwa lyenu, bahi ààve ntandi kunnyelangila mmahe ayu liyanga.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Anepo Yesu nkutepa kavila nkuva walemba muulongo. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Pavapilikene malove anelo, vanu vammalele nkutandilika kuukananga yumo-yumo, na vasele nni vánavele vatandi kuukananga. Vammalele nkuukananga nkuisalila chihi Yesu na ayula mmahe anaimidîle muyo mwake. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Yesu painamwike nkummuja ayula mmahe kuchidoni, “Vanu vanaimilenge apa vàvelenge kwachi? Dachi, nanga munu ahawîle kuva ùlembelewa uhwe?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Ayula mmahe nkuyang'ula kuchidoni, “Wala nanga munu, Nang'olo!” Bahi Yesu nkunnyaulila ayula mmahe kuchidoni, “Na nangu uchocho nikákuhukumu. Wako hwena chihi, henga unauyile kavila kutenda sambi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu njo nng'anje wa chilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kavila vanu kuchidoni, “Nangu nni Unene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Nangu nni Unene, lola Yohana 4:26. </char></note> nguhûmya nng'anje kwa vanu va pachilambo. Ambengupapâta nangu akambekwonga nnupi, ila àmbekuva na nng'anje uhûmya umi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Bahi Mafalisayo nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Ushahidi wako ukákulupilwa kuva wa uhiu, kwa kuva wako ulishuhudila chihi umwene.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Ata kungulishuhudila nimwene, henga ushahidi wangu nni wauhiu, kwa kuva, nangu ǹnipamala pachinu panguhaleke na panguhwena. Henga mwenu mukámaite pachinu panguhaleke wala panguhwena. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Mwenu mùhukumu chihi kwa ding'ano dya chimunu, henga nangu nanga paninnyukumu munu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Ata nikàhukumu, hukumu yangu ni ya uhiu, kwa kuva, nangu nikáhukumu weka, ila Atata angutumîle àvele pamo na nangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Na mu Sheliya yenu ìnilembwa kuva, ushahidi wa vanu vavili ùnakulupilwa kuva nni wa uhiu. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Nangu ngùlishuhudila nimwene, na Atata angutumîle nanang'e uchocho ànangushuhudila.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Bahi vanang'o nkummuja kuchidoni, “Atatako wako àvele kwachi?” Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Mwenu nanga pamungumaite nangu, na wala nanga pamummaite Atatangu. Henga kuikavele umungumala nangu, bahi mukanimmala na Atatangu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Yesu átangwele malove anelo pachihunda nnuwani lwa Ing'ande ya Nnungu pepi na pachinu palavele masanduku la sadaka. Na wala nanga munu anahulwile kunkamula, ing'anya uhiku wake wa kukamulwa wávele bado ukànambikamola.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kunguhwena nangu mwenu nkáhulula kuhwika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Bahi Yesu nkuvahaulila kavila kuchidoni, “Nangu mbènkuhwena, na mwenu mùmbengutaha, henga mwenu mùmbekuhwa ing'anya ya masambi lenu. Na kunguhwena nangu, mwenu mukáhulula kuhwika.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Bahi vakulu va Vayahudi pavapilikene malove anelo nkuchidoni, “Patangola kuva, ‘Kunguhwena nangu mwenu mukáhulula kuhwika.’ Dachi, àlembela aliwalale mwene?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Bahi Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Mwenu mùhaleke upano pahi, henga nangu ngùhaleke muha. Mwenu ni mmanu mmapachilambo achino, henga nangu nikávele wa pachilambo achino. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Njo mana nínnyaulidile kuva, mùmbekuhwa ing'anya ya masambi lenu. Na ikàva nanga pamumbekulupila kuva, ‘Nangu nni Unene,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa kutangola malove alano “Nangu nni Unene,” Yesu ànalitambulanga kwa kutumila lina lyanatumidile Nnungu kulitambulanga nchitabu cha Kuuka 3:14.</char></note> muhiu mùmbekuhwa ing'anya ya masambi lenu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Bahi vanang'o nkummuja kuchidoni, “Kwani wako nnani?” Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu njo ayula uninannyaulidile kutandiki patandi. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Nangu ngùvele na malove lohe la kutangola kumwamba mwenu na la kunnyukumu mwenu. Henga ayula angutumîle nangu nni wauhiu, na nangu nìvahaulila vanu va pachilambo àlalá langupilikene kuhaloka kwanga nang'e.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Henga avala vanu wala nanga pavanaelewije kuva Yesu àtangonavo kumwamba Atatake wa kulihunde. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Bahi Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Pamumbennyanyula Mwana wa Munu muha munsalaba, anepo njo pamumbemala kuva, ‘Nangu nni Unene,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Nangu nni Unene, lola Yohana 4:26.</char></note> na nni pamumbemala kuva, nanga chinu chingútênda kwa ding'ano dyangu nimwene, ila ngùtangola chihi àlalá langúhundîle Atata. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Na ayula angutumîle àvele pamo na nangu, wala akángulekile weka, ing'anya maduva lammalele ngùtenda lankatapalîla.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Bahi pachitangola malove anelo, vanu vohe váninkulupila.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vana vanga Nanchindenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Bahi Yesu nkuvahaulila avala Vayahudi vankulupidîle kuchidoni, “Mwenu mukàlakamula mahundo langu, muhiu mùmbekuva mmakuhundwa vangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Anepo njo pamumbeumala uhiu, na anewo uhiu ùmbentenda mukombolewe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Bahi avala vanu nkunnyang'ula Yesu kuchidoni, “Hwetu nni tuvanu tùvá lukolo lwanga Iblahimu, na tukánambikuva tuvatumwa tùvá munu woheyo. Hambi wako ùvele na mana ntwani pauhaula kuva, tuchitukombolewe?” <verse eid="JHN 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, kila munu atênda sambi ni ntumwa wa sambi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Ntumwa nanga pavalangiwa kuva mwanafamiliya maduva lammalele, henga mwana ànavalangiwa kuva mwanafamiliya maduva lammalele. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Mwana wa Nnungu akànkombola mwenu, bahi muchimukombolewe mwalehu. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Nangu ǹnimala kuva, mwenu ni mmanu mma lukolo lwa Iblahimu. Henga mùkudungila munguwalale ing'anya mwenu nkálatamwanga mahundo langu laikale mmitima yenu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Nangu ngùlatangola chihi àlalá lanilawene kwa Atatangu, henga mwenu mùlatenda àlalá lamulapilikene kwa atatawenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Bahi avala vanu nkunnyang'ula Yesu kuchidoni, “Hwetu nni tuvanu tùvá lukolo lwanga Iblahimu.” Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Mwenu mukàchiva mmanu mma lukolo lwanga Iblahimu, mukanilatenda àlalá lachilatenda Iblahimu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Hambi nangu nìnnyaulidile uhiu unguupilikene kwa Nnungu, pamo na anelo mwenu mùkudungila mumbwalale. Henga Iblahimu nanga panatendile uchocho! <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Mwenu mùlatenda àlalá lalatenda atatawenu.” Vanang'o nkunnyang'ula Yesu kuchidoni, “Hwetu tukee tuvana tuva halamu! Hwetu tùvele chihi na atata yumo bahi, yani Nnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Bahi Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Kwikavele Nnungu wava Atatawenu, mukaningutamwa nangu, kwa kuva, nangu ngùhaleke kwa Nnungu, na hambi ngùvele apano. Nangu nanga panguidile kwa mamulaka langu nimwene, ila kwa mamulaka la ayula angutumîle. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Mwadachi mwenu makálaelewa malove lángutangôla? Mwenu mukálaelewa malove langu ing'anya mukáhulula kulapwechela mahundo langu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Mwenu njo mmana mma atata wenu Ibilisi na mùlembela chihi kutenda àlalá lalalembela atatawenu. Nang'e nni nkúwalala maduva lammalele kutandikila patandi, nang'e nanga paendâna na uhiu, kwa kuva uhiu ukapali nkati mwake. Palambila, àtangola chihi itangodi yavelekwejije nayo, kwa kuva, nang'e ni nkúlambila na nni atata wa aneko kulambila. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Henga nangu ngùtangola chihi uhiu, na njo mana mwenu nkángukulupila! <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Alida mmwenu ahulûla kumaiha kuva nangu ngùvele na sambi? Na ikàva ngùtangola uhiu, mwadachi nkángukulupila? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Munu wanga Nnungu ànalapilikanila malove langa Nnungu. Henga mwenu nanga pamupilikanila ing'anya mwenu mukee mmanu mma Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iblahimu kabla akànambivelekwa Yesu ànipwawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Vayahudi nkunnyang'ula Yesu kuchidoni, “Dachi, hwetu tukáhawile uhiu kuva wako ni Nsamaliya na kuva wako ùvele na nanndenga?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Bahi Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu nikávele na nanndenga, ila nìmweshimu Atatangu, henga mwenu ǹnanguvenga. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Nangu nikálitahija ukulu wangu nimwene, ila ànipwawa yumo autâha ukulu anewo kwajili yangu, nanang'e nni nkúhukumu. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, munu woheyo akàlakamulila malove langu, aneyo munu akámbekuhwa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Bahi Vayahudi nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Hambi hwetu tùnimala kuva wako ùvele na anamindenga! Iblahimu ánihwa, na manabii na vanang'o vánihwa, na wako ùhaula kuva, ‘Munu woheyo akàlakamulila malove langu, aneyo akámbekuhwa mwiko!’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Dachi, wako ni nkulu kumpunda anakulwetu Iblahimu? Nang'e na manabii vánihwa. Dachi, wako ùlitenda kuva nnani?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Bahi Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu nikàlitumbyanga nimwene, ukulu wangu ukee na mana. Henga Atatangu umumwamba mwenu kuva Nnungu wenu, aneyo nni angutumbyânga nangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Mwenu nanga pamummaite, henga nangu ǹnimmala. Na nikàhaula kuva, nanga pangummaite, nìmbelambila muchi mwenu. Henga nangu ǹnimmala na nalakamula malove lake. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Anakulwenu Iblahimu ánilulutila namene, akuno walolela kulyona liduva linimbekwida nangu, na paliwene liduva anelyo, ánihangalala.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Bahi Vayahudi nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Wako wala ukánambikuva na vyaka amsini, hambi ùhaudachi kuva ùnimwona Iblahimu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, Iblahimu kabla akànambivelekwa nangu nanipwawa, kwa kuva, ‘Nangu nni Unene.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Nangu nni Unene, lola Yohana 4:26. </char></note> ” <verse eid="JHN 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Bahi Vayahudi nkulokotanga mayanga uchinga vammwalale Yesu kwa kunnyalangila mayanga, henga Yesu nkupihwa, nkuhuma nnuwani lwa Ing'ande ya Nnungu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vayahudi vambénnyalangila Yesu mayanga ing'anya ya kulitambulanga nang'e kuva Nnungu, apala patangwele kuva, “Nangu nni Unene.” Lola nchitabu cha Kuuka 3:14.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ànnamya munu aputêle meho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus healing blind man mud on eyes - WA03865" file="JesusHealingBlindMan_John9.1-7_1MudOnEyes_WA03865.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="9:0"/> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Bahi Yesu pachipita, nkumwona munu yumo aputêle meho kutandikila pavelekwejije. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Vakuhundwa vake nkummuja kuchidoni, “Nkúhunda, alida atendîle sambi, nni ayuno aputêle meho au vammalêke, mpaka avelekwe aputèlè meho?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Bahi Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Ayu munu akávelekwejije aputèlè meho ing'anya ya sambi yake au sambi ya vammalêke. Henga àvele uchocho uchinga matenda Nnungu laonekane kupitila nang'e. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Kwa kuva, muhi ùvechinkuhweneha, bahi tùlembelewa tulakole madengo la ayula angutumîle, kwa kuva, chilo chìvenkwida, uhiku wakahulula munu kukola madengo. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Pangupwawije pachilambo, nangu nni nng'anje wa pachilambo.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Bahi Yesu pamalidile kutangola malove anelo, nkusuna mata pahi, nkulamunyanga na ulongo kuva litope, nkumpakala ayula munu aputêle, mmeho. <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>Pamalidile kumpakala, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Hwena ukakalave medi nnitanda lya Siloamu,” mana ya lina alino ni “Atumwîje.” Bahi ayula munu aputêle, nkuhwena kulitanda unakalava medi, nkuuya aneko akuno walola.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Bahi avandikani mwave na avala vachimwôna anepo patandi wayuwayuwa, nkuva uvatangola kuchidoni, “Kwani ayu munu akee ayula achiikâla pahi wayuwayuwa?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Vanji nkuchidoni, “Nni nang'e.” Na vanji nkuchidoni, “Valandene chihi akee nang'e.” Henga mwene nkuchidoni, “Nni nangu!” <verse eid="JHN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Bahi vanu nkummuja kuchidoni, “Hambi ùpete dachi kulola?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Nang'e nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Ayula munu uvanchema Yesu, ámunyenge litope, nkungupaka mmeho, nkunguhaulila kuchidoni, ‘Hwena ukakalave medi kulitanda lya Siloamu.’ Nangu nkuhwena unakalava, na pangukaleve àlalá medi, nkùpata kulola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Bahi avala vanu nkummuja kavila kuchidoni, “Munu wene àvele kwachi?” Nang'e nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu nikámaite kwavele!”<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo vàuja namuna chalamile ayula munu anaputele meho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Bahi vanang'o nkumpelekeja kwa Mafalisayo ayula munu anaputele meho. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Na anelyo liduva lyanamunyenge Yesu litope nkunnamya ayula munu anaputele meho, lívele Liduva lya Kuyewelela. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Mafalisayo navanang'o nkutandilika kummuja ayula munu anaputele meho namuna chapete kulola. Nang'e nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Ángupakele litope mmeho, nangu nkunakalava medi, na hambi mbènkulola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Bahi Mafalisayo vanji nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Aneyo munu nanga pahalèkè kwa Nnungu, kwa kuva, nanga paikamula sheliya ya Liduva lya Kuyewelela.” Na vanji nkuva uvachidoni, “Ìhululika dachi munu avêle na masambi kutenda vimaiho vya masaibu malinga ala?” Nkutandilika uyavanyika. <verse eid="JHN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Bahi Mafalisayo nkummuja kavila ayula munu kuchidoni, “Kwa kuva nang'e nni akutendîle ulole, hambi wako uchidachi kwamba aneyo munu?” Nang'e nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nang'e ni nabii!”<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Henga vakulu va Vayahudi vanang'o nanga pavanakulupidile kuva munu aneyo áputele meho na hambi ànalola, bahi nkubidi vavacheme vammalêke ayula munu apête kulola. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>Pavakamwele, nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Dachi, ayuno nni mwanawenu umunnyaula kuva ávelekwejije akuno aputèlè meho? Hambi, àpete dachi kulola?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Bahi avala vammalêke nkuyang'ula kuchidoni, “Hwetu tùnimala kuva ayuno nni mwanawetu anavelekwejije aputèlè meho. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Henga hwetu nanga patumaite namuna chapete kulola, na wala nanga patummaite aneyo munu antendîle alole. Na kwa kuva nang'e nkulungwa, bahi mmujange achiayang'ule mwene.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Avala vammalêke, vátangwele uchocho ing'anya ya kuvayopa vakulu va Vayahudi, kwa kuva, vakulu va Vayahudi vánipatana kuva, munu woheyo ambennyambukîla Yesu kuva njo Kilisto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Kilisto, lola Yohana 1:41.</char></note>, àmbevingangwa muing'ande ya kunnyuwila Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Njo mana avala vammalêke, vàhawile kuva, “Nang'e nni munu nkulungwa, mmujange mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Bahi vanang'o nkunchema kavila ayula munu anaputele meho, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Hambi tangola uhiu kwa kunnyopa Nnungu. Hwetu tùnimala kuva ayuno munu àvele na masambi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Nang'e nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu nikákameke kuva nang'e nni munu avêle na masambi. Henga nangu ngùmaite chihi chinu chimo, kuva ngúputele meho, na hambi mbènkulola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Bahi vanang'o nkummuja kavila kuchidoni, “Àkutendeledile chamani? Àkulamije dachi meho lako?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Nang'e nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu tayali ǹninnyaulilanga, henga mwenu nkanatamwije kungupilikanila. Hambi mwadachi mùlembela ninnyaulile kavila? Dachi, na mwenu mùlembela mùùve mmakuhundwa vake?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Bahi vanang'o nkuntangolela malove lahakalenge na nkuchidoni, “Wako nni nkuhundwa wake, henga hwetu nni tuvakuhundwa vanga Musa! <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Hwetu tùnimala kuva Nnungu átangwele na Musa, henga ayuno munu tukámaite kwahaleke!” <verse eid="JHN 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Nang'e nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Achino nni chinu cha kukanganya! Mwenu mùhaula kuva mukámaite kwahaleke, henga nang'e nni angutendîle nangu ngulole! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Hwetu tùnimala kuva Nnungu akávapilikanila vanu vavêle na masambi, henga àvapilikanila vanu vammalele vamweshîmu Nnungu na kutenda lalalembela. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Kutandikila pachiumbwije chilambo tukánambipilikana kuva, ànipwawa munu awahîte kuntenda munu avelekwejîje aputèlè meho, alole. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Kwikavele ayuno munu akàhaloka kwanga Nnungu, akanahulule kutenda chinu chohecho!” <verse eid="JHN 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Bahi vanang'o nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Wako nni umunu wa masambi kutandikila kuvelekwa kwako, hambi ùmbetuhunda dachi hwetu?” Bahi nkumminganga muing'ande ya kunnyuwila Nnungu. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus healing blind man, thrown out - WA03866" file="JesusHealingBlindMan_John9.34_2ThrownOut_WA03866.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="9:34"/><verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munu anaputêle meho ànkulupila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Yesu nkupilikana kuva ayula munu anaputele meho ànivingangwa muing'ande ya kunnyuwila Nnungu. Bahi Yesu pakojene nawe nkummuja kuchidoni, “Dachi, wako ùnankulupila Mwana wanga Munu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Ayula munu nkunnyang'ula Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, wako nguhaulile chihi, nang'e ni nnani uchinga ngupate kunkulupila.” <verse eid="JHN 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Wako ùnimwona, na aneyo alonjêla na wako vino nni nang'e.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Ayula munu nkuchidoni, “Nang'olo, nangu nakulupila!” Bahi ayula munu nkunnyunamila Yesu, nkumwabudu.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Bahi Yesu nkuchidoni, “Nangu ngùidile apano pachilambo unahukumu, uchinga vanu vaputêle meho valole, na valôla vaputale meho.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Mafalisayo vanji vánavele pamo na nang'e vánipilikana malove anelo, nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Mwadachi wako ùhaula kuva hwetu tùputele meho?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Bahi Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Mwenu mukàchiva mmanu muputêle meho, mukánave na masambi. Henga kwa kuva mùlyona kuva mùnalola, bahi masambi lenu làvechinkupwawa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu àhumya nfano wa nchunga wambone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Shepherd carrying lamb - BK00007" file="ShepherdCarryingLamb_BK00007.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="10:0"/> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Yesu nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, munu woheyo akáinjila nchitundu cha dingandolo kwa kupitila pannango, ila àchitikila chihi kwa kukwela nchitundu, nang'e nni nkwîva na nkúpalaula. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Henga ayula ainjîla kwa kupitila pannango wa chitundu, aneyo nni nchunga wa angandolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Nlinzi wa chitundu ànanchimulila nnango nchunga, na angandolo vànapilikana lidi lya nchunga. Nchunga ànavachema angandolo vake kila ungandolo kwa lina lyake, na kuvalodya pawelu. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Pávahùmyà pawelu, ànavalongolelela, na angandolo vànampapata ing'anya vànilimala lidi lyake. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Anevo angandolo mwiko vakambempapata nnyeni, ila vànantukuta kwa kuva nanga pavalimaite lidi lya nnyeni.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yesu ávahaulidile nfano anewo, henga vanang'o nanga pavanamaite mana lake.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 10:6">Yesu njo nnango wa kuinjilila na nni nchunga wambone</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 10:6">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Sheepfold pen - LB00014" file="Sheepfold-Pen_Micah2.12_LB00014.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="10:6"/> <verse eid="JHN 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Bahi Yesu nkuhweneha kavila kutangola wachidoni, “Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, nangu ngùvele muchi nnango wa chitundu cha angandolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Vammalele vangulongoledîle nni vakwîva na vakúpalaula, henga angandolo nanga pavanavapilikanidile. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Nangu nni nnango wa angandolo. Munu woheyo ainjîla kwa kupitila kwang'une, àmbepohwa. Àmbeinjila nchitundu na kuhuma, na àmbepata vilyo. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Nkwîva páìdà, àida chihi unaiva na kuwalala na kwondonganga. Henga nangu ǹniida uchinga vanu vàpate umi, umi wa uhiu mwalehu.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>Nangu ngùvele muchi nchunga wambone. Nchunga wambone ààva tayali kuhwa ing'anya ya angandolo vake. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Munu wa chibaluwa, nang'e akee nchunga na wala akee mwene angandolo. Bahi palyona lihoha ulihaloka, ànavaleka angandolo, mwene nkutukuta. Anepo lihoha ànavabwilangila angandolo na kuvatenda vanji vahangalavane. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Aneyo munu ànatukuta kwa kuva, nang'e nni munu chihi wa chibaluwa na wala nanga pavajali angandolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>Nangu njo nchunga wambone. Ǹnivamala angandolo vangu, na vanang'o vàningumala, <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>malinga Atata changummaite nangu, na nangu chingummaite Atatangu. Uchocho nangu ngùvele tayali kuhwa ing'anya ya angandolo vangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Nangu ngùvele na angandolo vanji vakávele va chitundu achino, na ngùlembelewa nguidenavo, na vanang'o vàmbepilikana lidi lyangu, na kùmbekuva na likuwa limo lya angandolo na nchunga yumo.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>Atatangu ànangutamwa, kwa kuva ngùvele tayali kuhwa uchinga nguutwale umi wangu kavila. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Nanga munu àhulula ungupakanyola umi wangu, nangu ngùuhumya umi wangu kwa kulembela chihi nimwene. Na ngùvele na mamulaka la kuuhumya umi wangu na kuutwala kavila. Uvila nni changulaijije Atatangu ngutende.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Bahi ing'anya ya malove anelo, Vayahudi nkuyavanyika kavila. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Vanu vohe muanevo nkuchidoni, “Muhiu ayu munu àvele na nanndenga na nni n'ding'apedi! Mwadachi m̀menkupilikanila?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Henga vanu vanji nkuchidoni, “Malove latángôla ayu munu lakávele la munu avêle na nanndenga. Dachi, nanndenga ànahulula kulakusumbula meho la vanu vaputêle meho?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 10:21">Vayahudi vànnyita Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 10:21">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Priests challenge Jesus in Temple - CN01757" file="PriestsChallengeJesusInTemple_CN01757.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="10:21"/> <verse eid="JHN 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Bahi aneko ku Yelusalemu kúvele na Sikukuu ya Kuhimukila Kulimbuliwa kwa Ing'ande ya Nnungu. Na maduva anelo lávele maduva la chipwepwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Bahi Yesu nkuva waonga nnupenu lwa Ing'ande ya Nnungu, luvachema Lupenu lwa Selemani. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Bahi Vayahudi nkun'dinguka Yesu, nkummuja kuchidoni, “Dachi, hwetu tùmbekuva utukwaliha mpaka chakani? Ikàva wako njo Kilisto, bahi tuhaulile unatupihe.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Bahi Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu naninnyaulilanga mwenu, henga nkákulupila. Vitendo vya masaibu vingútênda nangu kwa mamulaka la Atatangu nni uvyovyo vinguhumîja nangu ushahidi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba lina, lola Yohana 1:12.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Henga mwenu nanga pamungukulupila ing'anya nanga pamuvele mmangandolo vangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Angandolo vangu vànalipilikana lidi lyangu, na nangu ǹnivamala, na vanang'o vànangupapata. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Nangu nìveng'a angandolo anevo umi ukee na ntululilo, na vanang'o mwiko vakambeyahika maduva lammalele, na nanga munu ambehulûla ungupakanyola mmakono mwangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Atatangu angupêle anevo angandolo nni nkulu kupunda vammalele, na nanga munu ahulûla kuvapakanyola mmakono mwa Atatangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Nangu na Atata nni chinu chimo.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Bahi Vayahudi pavapilikene malove anelo nkulokotanga kavila mayanga uchinga vammwalale Yesu kwa kumpanya mayanga. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nangu nìnnangujije mwenu masaibu lohe lambone kuhaloka kwa Atatangu. Bahi nguhaulile, lisaibu ntwani limumbengupanyila nangu mayanga?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Vayahudi nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Hwetu tukákupanya mayanga ing'anya ya masaibu lambone lutendile, ila ing'anya ya kunkufulu Nnungu! Wako nni munu chihi, henga ùlitenda kuva Nnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Bahi Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Ìnilembwa Mmalemba lenu kuva, Nnungu áhawile kuva, ‘Mwenu ni milungu.’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Bahi Malemba Lanaswe lakáhululika kupukutangwa. Ikàva Nnungu ávachemile milungu vanu avala vánapete lilove lyake, <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>hambi mwadachi mùhaula kuva nangu nìnkufulu Nnungu panguhaula kuva nangu nni Mwana wa Nnungu? Atata àningutandola nangu kuva niwake na kungutuma pachilambo. <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Bahi ikàva nangu nanga pangukola madengo la Atatangu, bahi nnangukulupile. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Henga ikàva ngùkola madengo la Nnungu, na mukátamwanga kungukulupila, bahi lakulupilange anelo masaibu uchinga mupate kumala na muhwenehe kumala kuva, Atata àvele nkati mwangu na nangu ngùvele nkati mwake.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Bahi Vayahudi nkulinga kavila kunkamula Yesu, henga Yesu nkuvapolonyoka mmakono lavo.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Bahi Yesu nkuhwena kavila kung'ambo muto wa Yoludani, pachinu pachivabatisija vanu Yohana Nkúbatisa, nkuikala aneko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Vanu vohe nkummwenela Yesu, nkuva uvahaula kuchidoni, “Yohana Nkúbatisa nanga panatendile lisaibu lyohelyo, henga malove lammalele lánatangwele Yohana kumwamba ayu munu nni muhiu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Na vanu vohe vánavele pachinu apala, nkunkulupila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Kuhwa kwanga Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Bahi pávele na munu yumo achiuûla, lina lyake Lasalo. Munu aneyo áikala chijiji cha ku Besaniya, chijiji chivachiikala anga Maliya na Masa alumbuvake Lasalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Maliya ayuno njo anampakele Nang'olo Yesu mahuta na kumpukutanga mmadodo kwa ulindo wake. Na Lasalo nkuluwe Maliya nni ánavele n'gonjo. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Bahi alumbuvake Lasalo nkutuma ujumbe kwanga Yesu kunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, nnyanja wako ayula untamwa namene, ànauula!”<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Bahi Yesu papilikene uchocho, nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Ntululilo wa ugonjo anewo ikambekuva chihi kuhwa, henga anewo ugonjo ùnimpata uchinga wonekane ukulu wanga Nnungu na kwa kupitila ugonjo anewo, Mwana wa Nnungu atumbyangwe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Yesu ánintamwa namene Masa na Maliya na Lasalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Henga Yesu papilikene kuva Lasalo ànauula, nkuhweneha kwikala maduva lanji mavili pachinu anepo. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila vakuhundwa vake kuchidoni, “Tuhweneng'ane kavila chilambo cha ku Yudeya!” <verse eid="JHN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Vakuhundwa vake nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nkúhunda, hambihambi Vayahudi vákudungidile vakupanye mayanga, vino mwadachi ùhaula tuhwene kavila ukwokwo?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yesu nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Dachi, liduva limo tenda lìvele na masaa kumi na mbili? Bahi munu akàonga muhi akambelikuvala. Munu aneyo àmbelola ing'anya pàvele na nng'anje wa chilambo achino. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Henga munu akàonga chilo àmbelikuvala kwa kuva pakávele na nng'anje.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Yesu pamalidile kutangola malove anelo, nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nnyanja wetu Lasalo ànilala, henga nangu ngùhwena ùnamwimula.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Vakuhundwa vake nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, ikàva ànilala, bahi achialame” <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Vanang'o vátenda kuva kulala luwono, kumbe nang'e áyamba kuhwa kwa Lasalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Bahi Yesu nanga panavapihite, nkuvahaulila chihi mwandu kuva, “Lasalo ànihila, <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>henga nangu nahangalala kwajili yenu kuva, nangu nikanapwawije aneko, uchinga mwenu mupate kukulupila. Hambi tuhweneng'ane kukaya kwake.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Bahi Tomaso, uvanchema Didimasi, nkuvahaulila vakuhundwa avake kuchidoni, “Na hwetu tuhweneng'ane tukahwe pamo na nang'e!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu njo Ufufulo na Umi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Bahi Yesu pahwikile aneko, nkukoja Lasalo avèlè munsati, na anelyo lívele liduva lya ncheche kutandikila liduva livansikile. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Chijiji cha ku Besaniya chívele pepi na ku Yelusalemu, mwanda wa kilometa dinatu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Na Vayahudi vohe vánikamola kukaya kwanga Maliya na Masa unavatuja ntima kwa nsiba wa Lasalo, nnumbwao.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Bahi Masa papilikene kuva Yesu àvenkwida, nang'e nkuhwena unachingamila, henga Maliya áisalidile chihi kukaya. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Masa nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, kwikavele ùùva upano, nnumbwangu akanahile. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Henga ǹnimala kuva, ata vino chinu chohecho chumbennyuwa Nnungu, achiakwing'e.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila Masa kuchidoni, “Nnumbulo achiafufuke.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Masa nkuyang'ula kuchidoni, “Ǹnimala kuva, àmbefufuka liduva lya ntululilo, pavambefufuliwa vanu vammalele.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nangu njo ufufulo na umi. Munu woheyo angukulupîla nangu, ata kwahwa, achiave mumi. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Kila munu aikâla nkati mwangu na kungukulupila, mwiko akambekuhwa. Dachi, ùnalakulupila alano?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Masa nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Elo Nang'olo, nangu nakulupila kuva wako njo Kilisto, Mwana wanga Nnungu, ayula achilolewa kwida pachilambo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ànfufula Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Masa pamalidile kutangola malove anelo, nkuhwena unanchema Maliya adadaye, nkunnyaulila paweka kuchidoni, “Nkúhunda ànikamola, na anakuchema.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Maliya papilikene uchocho, nkupiyanya kutakatuka, nkummwenela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Na Yesu ávele bado akànambikamola pachijiji, ávele chihi upala panapite Masa unachingamila. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Avala Vayahudi vánavele kukaya pamo na Maliya uvantuja ntima, pavammwene Maliya wapiyanya kutakatuka na kuhuma pawelu, nkunnondola. Vanang'o vátenda kuva àhwena kunsati unakuta.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Bahi Maliya pakamwele apala pávèlè Yesu, nkutindivala malundi muyo mwanga Yesu, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, kwikavele uuva upano nnumbwangu akanahile!” <verse eid="JHN 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Bahi Yesu pammwene Maliya na avala Vayahudi vánapapatene navo uvakuta, isungu nkumpwateka na kuhinginika muntima mwake. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Yesu nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Mùmmikile kwachi?” Vanang'o nkunnyaulila, “Nang'olo, ida upalole.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yesu nkukuta wahumya mihodi. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Bahi Vayahudi vánalongene na Maliya nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Lolanga namuna chantamwije!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Henga vanji nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Ayu munu ánnamije ayula munu anaputele meho. Dachi, akanahulwile kuntenda na Lasalo anahwe?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Bahi Yesu nkuhwika kunsati akuno isungu yake uimpwatèkà. Na anewo nsati wávele lipanga, linahinikwije na liyanga likulungwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yesu nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Liusang'anye anelyo liyanga!” Masa, nnumbuwe aneyo ahidîle, nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, hambi ànanung'a, kwa kuva nelo nni liduva lyancheche kutandikila pahidile!” <verse eid="JHN 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Dachi, nikákuhaulidile kuva ukàkulupila uchiuwone ukulu wanga Nnungu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Bahi vanang'o nkuliusa alila liyanga. Yesu nkulola muha kulihunde, nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Atata, nakushukulu kwa kuva wako ùnangupilikana. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Ǹnimala kuva ùnangupilikana maduva lammalele. Henga ngùtangwele malove anelo kwajili ya ààva vanu vavêle apano, uchinga vapate kukulupila kuva wako nni ungulaijîje.” <figure style="fig" alt="Lazarus resurrection" file="CN01768C.TIF" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="11:42"/><verse eid="JHN 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Pamalidile kutangola malove anelo, Yesu nkunonoha lidi wachidoni, “Lasalo, huma pawelu!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Bahi ayula munu anahwile, nkuhuma pawelu, akuno adingilijìjwè sanda mmadodo na mmakono, na kumeho kwake kuhinikwije chitambala. Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “N'dingulange, munneke alihwenele.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ntemelo wa kummwalala Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mako 14:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Bahi Vayahudi vohe vánapite kwanga Maliya, pavachiwene chitendo anecho chatendile Yesu, nkunkulupila. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Henga vanu vanji nkuhwena kwa Mafalisayo unavahaulila kuyamba achila chachitendile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Bahi makuhani vakulu pamo na Mafalisayo nkutenda lilonji lya Lukumbi Lukulu lwa Vayahudi, nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Tutende dachi? Lola ayuno munu chatenda vimaiho vyohe namene vya masaibu. <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Tukànneka chihi wahweneha, vanu vammalele vàmbenkulupila, na Valoma navanang'o vàmbekwida unaondonganga Ing'ande yetu ya Nnungu na vanu vetu!” <verse eid="JHN 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Bahi munu yumo nnikuwa anelyo uvanchema Kayafa, ánavele Kuhani Nkulu wa mwaka anecho, nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Mwenu nanga pamumaite chinu chohecho! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Dachi, mwenu mukóna kuva nni wasa munu yumo ahwe kwajili ya vanu vammalele, kuliko kuhwa vanu vammalele va chilambo achino?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Nang'e nanga panatangwele malove anelo kwa ding'ano dyake mwene, ila kwa kuva mwaka anewo nang'e ávele Kuhani Nkulu, ánilauja kuva, Yesu àmbekuhwa kwajili ya Vayahudi, <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>na akee chihi kwajili ya Vayahudi weka, henga pamo na vana va Nnungu vammalele vamwadilikêne pachilambo, uchinga avahimananye pamo na kuva chinu chimo.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Bahi kutandikila liduva anelyo, vakulu va Vayahudi nkuva uvatenda mitemelo ya kummwalala Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Bahi ing'anya ya anelyo, Yesu nanga panaongile kavila kwa kulilanguja kwa Vayahudi, ila ániuka anepo pamo na vakuhundwa vake nkuhwena pachinu pánavele pepi na lilanga, chijiji chimo chichêmwa Efulaimu. Nkuikala aneko pamo na vakuhundwa vake. <verse eid="JHN 11:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Na kwa kuva Sikukuu ya Vayahudi ichêmwa Pasaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Pasaka, lola Yohana 2:13.</char></note> yávele pepi, bahi vanu vohe kuhaloka mmijiji, nkuhwena ku Yelusalemu uchinga valihahule, kabla ikànambikamola sikukuu. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Bahi vanu nkuva uvantaha Yesu. Na pávanavele pamo nnuwani lwa Ing'ande ya Nnungu, nkuva uvaujana kuchidoni, “Mwenu mwòna dachi? Dachi, nni muhiu kuva nanga pambeida kusikukuu aino?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Makuhani vakulu pamo na Mafalisayo váhumije amuli kuva, munu woheyo ambepamâla pachinu pavêle Yesu, avahaulile uchinga vankamule.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu àpakwa mahuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mako 14:3-9</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 7:36-50">Luka 7:36-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Woman anointing Jesus Feet - CN01778" file="WomanAnointingJesus'FeetWithPerfume_CN01778.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="12:0"/> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Palanaisalidile maduva sita kuhwika Sikukuu ya Vayahudi ichêmwa Pasaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Pasaka, lola Yohana 2:13.</char></note>, Yesu nkuhwena ku Besaniya, chijiji chachiikala Lasalo, ayula wananfufwile Yesu kuhaloka kukuhwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Aneko nkwandaliwa chakulya cha lyulo kwa eshima yanga Yesu. Masa nkuva wavahudumila, na Lasalo ávele yumo wa vanu vachîlya pamo na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Bahi Maliya nkutwala nusu lita ya mahuta lakunung'ila, lagalîka namene, nkulapaka mmadodo langa Yesu na kulapukutanga madodo kwa ulindo wake. Na ing'ande yammalele nkunung'ila chihi mahuta anelo. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Bahi nkuhundwa yumo wanga Yesu uvanchema Yuda Isikaliote, ayula anantengeleke Yesu lukoto, nkuhaula kuchidoni, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>“Mwadachi mahuta ala lakásumisijwe kwa dihela dyohe namene, nkuveng'a amahuvani dihela anedyo?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Munsitali auno Yohana àlembile “dinali 300.” Munu álipwa dinali imo kwa madengo la kawaida la liduva limo. Hambi dinali 300 nni sawa na nshahala wa kawaida wa malipo la maduva 300.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Yuda átangwele uchocho akee kuchi ávavikila chididi amahuvani, henga ing'anya ávele nkwiva. Na nang'e njo achichunga mpatila wa dihela, akuno wadakola dihela dichivikwa mumpatila anewo. <verse eid="JHN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Henga Yesu nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Nnekange, kwa kuva àtendile uchocho kwajili ya kuutayalisha mmili wangu kwa kungusika. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Anevo amahuvani mùmbekuvanavo maduva lammalele, henga mukámbekuva na nangu maduva lammalele.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ntemelo wa kummwalala Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Vayahudi vohe vánipilikana kuva Yesu ávele ku Besaniya. Bahi nkuhweneng'ana ukwokwo, akee chihi ing'anya ya Yesu, henga pamo na kunannola na Lasalo anafufuliwije na Yesu kuhaloka kukuhwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Bahi makuhani vakulu nkutenda ntemelo wa kummwalala na Lasalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>kwa kuva, ing'anya ya Lasalo, Vayahudi vohe vánilinyemya na vakulu vao, nkunkulupila Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:11">Yesu àinjila muimanga ya Yelusalemu kwa kuhangalala</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 12:11">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mako 11:1-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:11">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Triumphal entry - Dunham DN00487" file="TriumphalEntry_DN00487.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="12:11"/> <verse eid="JHN 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Liduva lipapete, likuwa likulu lya vanu vanaidile ku Yelusalemu kusikukuu ya Vayahudi ichêmwa Pasaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layamba Pasaka, lola Yohana 2:13.</char></note> vánipilikana kuva, Yesu ávele nndila kwida ya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Bahi nkutwalanga dinavi dya mitende, nkuhwena unanchingamila, akuno uvanonoha lidi uvachidoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">“Atumbyangwe Nnungu! Ubalikiwe wako uîda kwa lina lya Nang'olo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">Ubalikiwe wako Nfalume wa Isilaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Yesu ánkojije mwana wa punda, nkumwikala, malinga chiilembwije Mmalemba Lanaswe kuva,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>“Munayope, mwenu mmenedi mma imanga ya ku Yelusalemu!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Auno nsitali ùlembwijé “Sayuni” na Vayahudi vátúmílá lina anelyo uvamba imanga ya Yelusalemu. Na maeleso layâmba Sayuni, lola Matayo 21:5.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Lola, Nfalume wenu àvenkwida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">ànkwedile mwana wa punda.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Anepo patandi vakuhundwa vake nanga pavanamaite mana la mambo anelo, henga Yesu patumbyengwe kwa kuhwa kwake nni pavakumbukidile kuva malove anelo lánilembwa Mmalemba Lanaswe kumwamba nang'e, na njo vanu chivantendedile.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Vanu vammalele vánavele pamo na Yesu wakati pananchemile Lasalo kuhaloka munsati na kunfufula kuhaloka kukuhwa, vánishuhudila anelo lanatendile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Bahi ing'anya ya anelyo, vanu vohe namene vánihwena unanchingamila Yesu, kwa kuva vánipilikana kuva Yesu njo atendîle chimaiho cha lisaibu anelyo. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Bahi Mafalisayo pavalawene anelo, nkuhaulanila kuchidoni, “Wala nanga chinu chitumbehulula kutenda. Lola, vanu vammalele vànituleka nkumpapata nang'e.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu àlauja kuyamba kuhwa kwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Pávele na Vagiliki fulani vanaidile ku Yelusalemu unnannyuwa Nnungu mahiku la Sikukuu ya Vayahudi ya Pasaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Pasaka, lola Yohana 2:13.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Bahi vanu anevo nkummwenela Filipo ánavele mwenedi wa ku Betisaida chilambo cha ku Galilaya, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, hwetu tùlembela tumwone Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filipo nkuhwena unannyaulila Anduleya, bahi vammalele vavili nkuukananga nkuhwena unannyaulila Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Uhiku wa kutumbyangwa kwa Mwana wa Munu tayali ùnikamola. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, imbeyu ya ngano ikànamatokele muulongo nkuhwa, ìisalila chihi uchocho kuva imbeyu imo. Henga ikàmatokela muulongo nkuhwa, ìnamela na kuhumya vihepo vyohe. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Munu woheyo autâmwa namene umi wake nchilambo achino kupunda chantamwa Nnungu, aneyo akambekuva na umi ukee na ntululilo, na munu woheyo akáutamwa namene umi wake nchilambo achino, aneyo àmbekuva na umi ukee na ntululilo. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Munu woheyo akàlembela ungutumikila nangu àlembelewa angupapate nangu, na pachinu pohepo panimbekuva nangu njo upopo pambekûva ntumishi wangu. Na munu akàngutumikila nangu, bahi Atata achiamweshimu munu aneyo.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>Hambi isungu yangu ìnakambakamba. Dachi, ngutangole chinu ntwani? Dachi, ninnyuwe Atata angupohe muuhiku auno wa kubanika? Nanga, nangu ǹniida kwajili ya àlalá lambetendêka muuhiku auno. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Atata, litumbyange lina lyako!” Bahi nkupilikanika lidi kuhaloka kulihunde ulichidoni, “Ǹnilitumbyanga, na nguchinilitumbyange kavila.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Likuwa lya vanu vanaimidile pachinu apala pavapilikene lidi anelyo nkuchidoni, “Anelyo nni lidi lya ing'uva!” Vanji nkuchidoni, “Malaika ànitangonawe!” <verse eid="JHN 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Henga Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Lidi alino likápilikanike ing'anya yang'une, henga kwajili yenu mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Uhiku wa kuhukumiwa kwa chilambo achino ùnikamola. Hambi Nanchindenga ntawala wa chilambo achino àmbeyahwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Henga nangu panimbenyanyuliwa muha chilambo, nìmbevatenda vanu vammalele vaide kwang'une.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Yesu átangwele uchocho kulanguja namuna chambekuhwa muha nsalaba.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Bahi likuwa lya vanu nkunnyang'ula Yesu kuchidoni, “Hwetu tùnipilikana Mmalemba Lanaswe kuva, Kilisto àmbekuva na umi ukee na ntululilo. Hambi wako ùhaula dachi kuva Mwana wa Munu àlembelewa anyanyuliwe muha? Na aneyo Mwana wa Munu ni nnani?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nng'anje bado ùvele pamo na mwenu kwa uhiku kadiki. Bahi onganga upopa pamuvele na nng'anje, uchinga lupi lunannyunike, kwa kuva, aônga nnupi akápamaite pachinu pahwena. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Bahi upopa paupwawije nng'anje, ukulupilange anewo nng'anje, uchinga mùùve mmana mma nng'anje.” Yesu pamalidile kutangola malove anelo, nkuuka, nkuhwena unalipiha kulehu na alila likuwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vayahudi vakákulupila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Ikànava Yesu átendile vimaiho vya masaibu anelo lammalele pameho pavo, henga nanga pavanankulupidile. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Anelo lánitendeka uchinga latimile malove lanatangwele nabii Isaya kuva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Nang'olo, nnani akulupidîle habali ituyanjajije?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Nnani ahunukuliwîje matendo la dimongo dyanga Nang'olo?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Na uchocho, vakanahulule kukulupila kupapatana na malove la Isaya kuva,<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>“Nnungu ànilaputaja meho lavo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">na kudiidyopya ding'ano dyavo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">uchinga vanahulule kulola kwa meho lavo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">au kumala kwa ding'ano dyavo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">uyopa vànannaukila Nnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">nanang'e nkuvalamya.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isaya átangwele malove anelo kwa kuva ániwona ukulu wa Yesu na kuhaula habali dyake.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Anepo vakulu vohe va Vayahudi váninkulupila Yesu. Henga ing'anya ya kuvayopa Mafalisayo, nanga pavanahawile kuva vànikulupila uvayopa vànavingangwa n'ding'ande dya kunnyuwila Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Vanang'o vánitamwa namene kulombolewa na vanu kuliko kulombolewa na Nnungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munu ankulupîla Yesu, ànkulupila na ayula antumîle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Yesu nkunonoha lidi nkuchidoni, “Munu woheyo angukulupîla nangu, akángukulupila chihi nangu, henga ànkulupila na ayula angutumîle. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Na munu woheyo angwôna nangu, uchocho àmwona na ayula angutumîle. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Nangu ngùidile pachilambo uchinga ngùùve muchi nng'anje, uchinga ayula angukulupîla anaikale nnupi. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Munu akàlapilikana malove langu koka analakamule, anepo nike nangu nimbennyukûmu. Kwa kuva, nangu nikáidile unavahukumu vanu va pachilambo, henga ngùidile unavapoha. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Munu anguhîta nangu na malove langu, malove àlalá langutangwele nni lambennyukûmu munu aneyo liduva lya ntululilo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Kwa kuva, nangu nikanatangwele kwa mamulaka langu nimwene, henga Atata angutumîle nni angulaijîje malove lammalele langutangola. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Nangu ǹnimala kuva, amuli dyake njo divatênda vanu vààve na umi ukee na ntululilo. Bahi uchila changuhaulidile Atata njo uchila chingutangola nangu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu àvakalavya vakuhundwa vake madodo pachakulya cha Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Bahi uhiku wa Sikukuu ya Vayahudi ichêmwa Pasaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Pasaka, lola Yohana 2:13.</char></note> wavele pepi kuhwika. Na Yesu ánimala kuva uhiku wake wa kuuka pachilambo na kuhwena kwa Atatake ùnikamola. Na ánivatamwa namene vanu vake vavêle pachilambo, na ánivatamwa mpaka kuntululilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Yesu pamo na vakuhundwa vake pavanavenkulya chakulya chalyulo, Ibilisi ávele antadìlè Yuda mwana wanga Simoni Isikaliote makudungilo la kuntengeleka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Na Yesu ánimala kuva Atatake ànkamujije vitukutuku vyammalele, na ánimala kuva áhaleke kwanga Nnungu na àuya kwanga Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Bahi Yesu, nkutakatuka pameza, nkuula likoti lyake, nkutwala litaulo nkulihunga nchikundu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Anepo nkutaya medi nchikalango, nkutandilika kuvakalavya vakuhundwa vake madodo na kuvapukutanga kwa alila litaulo lyanahungile nchikundu. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus washes Peter's feet" file="cn01799C.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="13:5"/><verse eid="JHN 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Paikamwele samu yanga Petulo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:6,9,24,36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mmisitali aino ìlembwije “Simoni Petulo,” malina anelo mavili lávele la munu yumo, yani Petulo. Simoni lyávele lina linji lyanga Petulo.</char></note> nang'e nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, muhiu wako ùmbengukalavya nangu madodo?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yesu nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Chíngutèndà wako ukambechimala hambi, henga uchiuchimale lukoto.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Petulo nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Mwiko wako ukambengukalavya nangu madodo!” Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Nikanakukalavye, wako ukee chinu chimo na nangu.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Petulo nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Nang'olo ngukalavye, henga akee chihi madodo weka, ila ngukalavye makono na mmuti mwalehu.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila Petulo kuchidoni, “Munu alihingîle àlembelewa chihi akalave mmadodo bahi, kwa kuva mmili wake wammalele ùnihahuka. Na mwenu mùnihahuka, henga akee mwenu mmammalele muhahwîke.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Yesu ánimmala ayula ambentengelêka, njo mana áhawile kuva, “ake mwenu mmammalele muhahwîke.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Yesu pamalidile kuvakalavya madodo, nkuwala kavila likoti lyake, nkunaikala pachinu panaikele kanandi, nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Dachi, mùnimala mana la alino lingulitendile? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Mwenu mùnguchema nangu kuva, ‘Nkúhunda’ na ‘Nang'olo,’ na mwenu mùtangola uhiu, kwa kuva nni chinguvele. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Bahi ikàva nangu ngujukîle Nang'olo na Nkúhunda wenu, nìnkalavije mwenu madodo lenu, bahi na mwenu uchocho mùlembelewa mukalavyane madodo mmene kwa mmene. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Nangu nìmpele mwenu nfano, uchinga na mwenu mutende malinga nangu chinintendeledile mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, ntumwa nanga pávà nkulu kumpunda nang'olo wake, wala n'jumbe nanga pávà nkulu kumpunda ayula antumîle. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Bahi ikàva mùnilamala anelo, mùmbekuva na wasa mukàlatenda.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 13:17">Yesu àlauja kuva Yuda àmbentengeleka</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 13:17">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayo 26:20-25</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mako 14:17-21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:17">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Last supper - WA03909" file="LastSupper(12Disciples)_WA03909.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="13:17"/> <verse eid="JHN 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>“Alano làngutangola lakánnyamba mwenu mmammalele. Nangu ǹnivamala avala univatandwele. Henga lasima latimile Malemba Lanaswe lahaûla kuva, ‘Ayula alîle chakulya pamo na nangu, àningupindikuka kuva mmongo wangu.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Nangu nìnnyaulila mwenu vino, kabla anelo lammalele lakànambihumila, uchinga palambehumila, mukulupile kuva, ‘Nangu nni Unene.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, ampwechelêla ayula unguntumîle, àngupwechelela na nangu, na munu angupwechelêla nangu, àmpwechelela na ayula angutumîle.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Yesu patangwele malove anelo isungu yake nkukambakamba, nkuchidoni, “Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, munu yumo mmwenu àmbengutengeleka.” <verse eid="JHN 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Vakuhundwa nkulolana, kwa kuva nanga pavachimmala ayula wachimmwamba. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Na nkúhundwa yumo muavala vakuhundwa vake, anatamwîjwe namene na Yesu, áyamene na Yesu pavanavele nkulya. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Bahi Petulo nkunkapila ayula nkuhundwa, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Mmuje àmwamba nnani.” <verse eid="JHN 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Bahi ayula nkuhundwa nkuntepela Yesu, nkummuja kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, ùmwamba nnani?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yesu nkuyang'ula kuchidoni, “Ayula unimbemwing'a chibeduli cha nkate chinimbechuvika m'bakuli, nni uyoyo.” Bahi Yesu nkuchuvika chibeduli cha nkate m'bakuli nkumwing'a Yuda mwana wanga Simoni Isikaliote. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Yuda papwecheledile chihi achila chibeduli, Nanchindenga nkumwenda. Bahi Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Anecho chumbetenda, piyanya kuchitenda!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Henga wala munu yumo muavala vanaikele pachakulya anamaite ing'anya ntwani annyaulidile uchocho. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Yuda kwa kuva ávele nkúkondya dihela, vakuhundwa vanji vátenda kuva Yesu ànnyaulidile akasume vitukutuku vilembelêwa kwajili ya sikukuu, au akaveng'e amahuvani chinu chohecho. <verse eid="JHN 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Bahi Yuda papwechedile achila chibeduli cha nkate, upala nkuhuma pawelu. Na uhiku wene anewo, wávele chilo. <figure style="fig" alt="Judas leaving upper room - CN01802" file="JudasLeavingUpperRoom_John13.30_CN01802.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="13:30"/><verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amuli yahambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Yuda paukile, Yesu nkuchidoni, “Hambi Mwana wa Munu ànitumbyangwa, na Nnungu ànitumbyangwa kupitila Mwana wa Munu. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Na ikàva Nnungu ànitumbyangwa kupitila nang'e, bahi na Nnungu mwene àmbentumbyanga nang'e, na akambetima kuntumbyanga.<verse eid="JHN 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Mmanavangu, nangu ngùvele pamo na mwenu kwa mahiku kadiki. Mùmbengutaha, henga malinga chinivahaulidile vakulu va Vayahudi, hambi nìnnyaulilanga na mwenu kuva, kunguhwena nangu, mwenu mukambehulula kwida. <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Nangu nìmwing'anga amuli yahambi kuva, tamwana. Malinga nangu chinintamwije mwenu, na mwenu tàmwana uchocho. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Mwenu mukàtamwana, vanu vammalele vachivamale kuva mwenu nni mmakuhundwa vangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu àlauja kuva Petulo àmbenkana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mako 14:27-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Petulo nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, ùhwena kwachi?” Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Kunguhwena nangu, kwa hambi ukambehulula kungupapata, henga uchiungupapate paida.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Petulo nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, ing'anya ntwani nikáhulula kukupapata hambi? Nangu ngùvele chihi tayali kuhwa ing'anya yakuwe.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Dachi, muhiu kuva ùvele tayali kuhwa ing'anya yang'une? Nangu nìkuhaulila uhiu kuva, ung'uku nannume kabla akànambikongovela, wako ùmbekuva ungukanile myanda mitatu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu njo indila ya kuhwena kwa Atata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Crosses seen through gateway - HK00325" file="CrossesSeenThroughGateway_HK00325.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="14:0"/> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila vakuhundwa vake kuchidoni, “Mwenu wala munakambekambe mmitima mwenu. Nkulupilange Nnungu, na ngukulupilange na nangu mwalehu. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Nng'ande mwa Atatangu mùvele nafasi yohe, kwikavele ikàva uchocho nikàvele nìnnyaulidile. Na hambi ngùhwena unamwandalila anepo pachinu. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Nikàmalila kumwandalila mwenu pachinu, nguchinguuye nikantwalange, uchinga apala panimbekuva nangu na mwenu mùùve upopo. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Na mwenu mùniimala indila ìhwena aneko kunguhwena nangu.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tomaso nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, hwetu tukámaite kuuhwena, hambi tùmbehulula dachi kuimala aneyo indila?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu njo Indila, na Uhiu na Umi. Nanga munu ahulûla uhwena kwa Atata Nnungu bila kupitila kwang'une. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Ikàvele umungumala nangu, mukanimmala na Atatangu mwalehu. Na kutandikila hambi mùnimmala, na tayali mùnimwona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filipo nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, tulanguje Atata Nnungu, na hwetu tuchitutolele.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila Filipo nkuchidoni, “Filipo, ngùtandilike machedo kwikala na mwenu mpaka hambi, dachi kuva ukánangumala? Anguwêne nangu, àmmwene na Atata Nnungu. Hambi wako ùhulula dachi kuhaula kuva, ‘Tulanguje Atata Nnungu?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Dachi, wako ukákulupila kuva nangu ngùvele nkati mwa Atata Nnungu na Atata Nnungu àvele nkati mwangu? Malove laninnyaulila mwenu lakáhaloka chihi kwang'une, ila Atata Nnungu àvele nkati mwangu nni akôla madengo lake kupitila nangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Ngukulupilange nangu, panguhaula kuva, nangu ngùvele nkati mwa Atata Nnungu na Atata Nnungu àvele nkati mwangu. Ikàva nkátamwanga kukulupila uchocho, bahi kulupilanga ing'anya ya masaibu langulatenda. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, angukulupîla nangu, nang'e achialatende àlalá langulatenda nangu, na achiahalije kutenda makulu kupunda ala, ing'anya nangu ngùhwena kwa Atata Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Na chinu chohecho chimumbeyuwa kwa lina lyangu, nguchinguchitende, uchinga Atata Nnungu apate kutumbyangwa kupitila Mwanawe. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Na nkànguyuwa chinu chohecho kwa lina lyangu, nguchinguchitende.”<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Umumu Wanaswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>“Mukàngutamwa nangu, muchimudikamule amuli dyangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Na nangu nguchininnyuwe Atata Nnungu, nanang'e achiamwing'e mwenu Nkúyangata yunji, aikale na mwenu bila ntululilo. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Nang'e nni Umumu wa uhiu. Vanu va pachilambo vakáhulula kumpwechela, kwa kuva vakámwona na wala vakámmaite. Henga mwenu mùnimmala kwa kuva àikala pamo na mwenu na àmbekuva nkati mwenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>Nikambennekanga mwenu mùùve muchi mmana vachiva, henga nguchinimwidile mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Ùisalidile chihi uhiku kadiki, vanu va pachilambo vakambengwona, henga mwenu muchimungwone. Kwa kuva nangu nimumi, na mwenu uchocho mùmbekuva mmumi. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Na palimbekamola anelyo liduva muchimumale kuva nangu ngùvele nkati mwa Atatangu, na mwenu mùvele nkati mwangu na nangu ngùvele nkati mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>Munu woheyo adipwechêla amuli dyangu na kudikamula, nang'e nni angutâmwa. Na munu angutâmwa nangu, Atatangu achiantamwe munu aneyo, na nangu nguchinguntamwe na kulilanguja kwa munu aneyo.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Bahi Yuda, akee ayula Yuda Isikaliote, nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, ìmbehululika dachi ulimaihe kwetu hwetu na akee kwa vanu va pachilambo?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Munu akàngutamwa nangu achialakamule mahundo langu, na Atatangu achiantamwe munu aneyo, na hwetu tuchituide kwanga nang'e na kwikala nawe. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Munu akángutamwa nangu, nang'e akálakamula malove langu. Na mahundo lamupilikene lakávele langu, ila ni la Atata Nnungu angutumîle.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>Nangu nìnnyaulidile alano vino, panguvele pamo na mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Henga Atata Nnungu àmbentuma Nkúyangata kwa niaba yangu, yani Umumu Wanaswe. Na aneyo Umumu achiannyunde kila chinu na kunkumbusanga lammalele laninnyaulidile.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nsitali auno ùlembwije “àmbentuma mulina lyangu.” Kuntuma munu mulina, mana lake, ahwene kwa niaba ya munu mwene lina anelyo. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>Nangu nìnnekelanga amani. Amani yangu nìmwing'anga mwenu. Nangu nikámwing'a mwenu amani aino muchi chilambo chichihumya. Munakambekambe mmitima yenu na wala munayope. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Múningupilikana panichinnyaulila kuva, ‘Nangu nguvenkuhwena, na nguchinguuye kavila kwenu mwenu.’ Na mwenu mukàchiva umungutamwa nangu, bahi nkanihangalala ing'anya ngùhwena kwa Atata Nnungu, kwa kuva, nang'e njo nkulu upunda nangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Nangu nìnnyaulidile malove alano hambi kabla lakànambihumila, uchinga palambehumila mupate kukulupila. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Nangu nikambetangola kavila malove lohe na mwenu, kwa kuva, Nanchindenga ntawala wa chilambo achino àvenkwida. Na nang'e akee na dimongo kwang'une, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>henga vanu va pachilambo vàlembelewa vamale kuva nangu nàntamwa Atata Nnungu, na njo mana ngùtenda kila chinu malinga changulaijije. Hambi imilanga, tuukanange apano!”<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu njo nzabibu uhiu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Vine and grapes - LB00107" file="Vine&amp;Grapes+Supports_LB00107.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="15:0"/> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila vakuhundwa vake kuchidoni, “Nangu njo nzabibu uhiu, na Atatangu njo nkúlima. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Na kila lutavi lulundêne na nangu lukànape vihepo, nang'e analucheketa, na kila lutavi lûpa vihepo, nang'e ànaluhunila uchinga luhalije kupa namene. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Mwenu tayali munihunwa na kuhahulwa kupitila mahundo laninnyaulidile. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Hweneha kulundana na nangu, na nangu nguchinguhwenehe kulundana na mwenu. Malinga lutavi chilukahulula weka kupa vihepo lukanalundane na nzabibu, uchocho na mwenu nkáhulula weka kupa vihepo mukanahwenehe kulundana na nangu.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>Nangu njo nzabibu na mwenu njo dinavi. Munu woheyo ahwenêha kulundana na nangu, na nangu nikàhweneha kulundana nawe, munu aneyo àpa vihepo vyohe, kwa kuva, bila nangu mwenu nanga chimumbehulula kuchitenda. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Munu woheyo akáhweneha kulundana na nangu, aneyo àvele muchi lutavi luyâhwa pawelu, nkuyuma. Dinavi malinga anedyo, dìnalokotanywa na kuyahwa mmoto, nkupya. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Mukàhweneha kulundana na nangu na malove langu lakàikala nkati mwenu, yuwanga chinu chohecho chimulembela, na muchimutendewe. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Mwenu mukàpa vihepo vyohe, mùva mmakuhundwa vangu mma uhiu, na mukàva uchocho Atatangu achiatumbyangwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Malinga Atata changutamwije nangu, uchocho na nangu nni chinguntamwije mwenu. Bahi hweneha kuikalanga muitamwi yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Mukàdikamula amuli dyangu muchimuhwenehe kuikala muitamwi yangu, malinga nangu chinidikamwile amuli dya Atatangu na kuhweneha kuikala muitamwi yake. <verse eid="JHN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>Nangu nìnnyaulidile mwenu malove alano uchinga muhangalale malinga chinguhangalala nangu, na ihangaladi yenu ììve ing'ulu. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Aino njo amuli yangu inimwing'anga mwenu, Tamwana, malinga nangu chinintamwanga mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Nanga munu avêle na itamwi ing'ulu kupunda aino ya munu kukubali kuhwa kwajili ya ayanjavake. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Mwenu nni mmayanjavangu, mukàtenda àlalá laninnaija. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Nangu nikánchema mwenu kuva mmatumwa, kwa kuva, ntumwa nanga pamaite lalatenda nang'olo wake. Henga nangu nìnchema mwenu kuva ayanjavangu kwa kuva ǹninnyaulilanga lammalele langupilikene kwa Atatangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Akee mwenu mungutandwêle nangu, henga nangu njo nintandwêle mwenu na kuntuma muhwene mukape vihepo na vihepo vyenu vihwenehe kupwawa, uchinga Atata Nnungu amwing'e mwenu chinu chohecho chimumbennyuwa kwa lina lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Bahi amuli inimwing'anga mwenu nni aino, Tamwana.”<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu va pachilambo vàmmenga Yesu na vakuhundwa vake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>Bahi Yesu nkuhweneha kutangola kuchidoni, “Vanu va pachilambo vakàmmenga mwenu, mumale kuva vàtandilike unguvenga nangu kabla vakànambimmenga mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Kuikavele umuva mmanu mmapano pachilambo, vanu va pachilambo vakanintamwa malinga chivavatamwa vanu vake. Henga nangu nìntandwele mwenu kuhaloka nchilambo achino, na mwenu mukee mmanu mmachilambo achino kavila, njo mana vanu va pachilambo vànammenga. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Himukila malove laninnyaulidile kuva, ntumwa nanga pávà nkulu kumpunda nang'olo wake. Ikàva vàngulagihije nangu, na mwenu uchocho muchimulagihwe. Na ikàva vànilakamula mahundo langu, bahi vachivalakamule na mahundo lenu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Henga anelo lammalele vàmbentendela mwenu, ing'anya yang'une, kwa kuva, nanga pavammaite ayula angutumîle. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Ikàchiva nikáida únatangonavo, wala vakánave na masambi, henga hambi vakee na mwakukanila masambi lavo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Munu anguvênga nangu, aneyo àmmenga na Atatangu mwalehu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Kuikavele nikátenda kwavo mambo lakánambitendwa na munu woheyo vakánave na masambi. Henga hambi vànilona mambo anelo, na vàvechinkutuvenga, nangu pamo na Atatangu mwalehu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Henga vàtendile uchocho uchinga latimile Malemba Lanaswe lalembwîjwe mu Sheliya yavo kuva, ‘Vánguvengile chihi bila ing'anya!’<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>Na pámbeìdà aneyo Nkúyangata unimbentuma kwenu mwenu kuhaloka kwa Atata Nnungu, nang'e àmbengushuhudila nangu. Nang'e nni Umumu wa uhiu ahalôka kwa Atata Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Na mwenu uchocho, muchimungushuhudile nangu, kwa kuva mùvele pamo na nangu kutandikila patandi.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>Yesu nkuhweneha kutangola kuchidoni, “Nangu nìnnyaulidile malove anelo lammalele uchinga munaleke kukulupila. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Mùmbevingangwa n'ding'ande dya kunnyuwila Nnungu. Na ùmbehwika uhiku, munu woheyo akàmmwalala mwenu àmbetenda kuva àntumikila Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Vàmbetendanga mambo anelo ing'anya nanga pavammaite Atata Nnungu na wala nanga pavangukameke nangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Nìnnyaulidile anelo, uchinga paumbehwika uhiku anewo muhimukile kuva, nangu naninnyaulila.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Madengo la Nkúyangata, yani Umumu Wanaswe</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Nangu, nikanannyaulidile malove alano patandi ing'anya nangu ngúvele pamo na mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Henga hambi ngùhwena kwanga ayula angutumîle na wala nanga munu angûja kuva, ‘Ùhwena kwachi?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Henga ing'anya nìnnyaulidile malove anelo, mitima yenu ìvele nnihindambi likulu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, wasa kwenu mwenu nangu nikàhwena, kwa kuva, nangu nikànahwene, aneyo Nkúyangata, yani Umumu Wanaswe akambekwida kwenu mwenu. Henga nangu nikàhwena nguchinguntume aide kwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Nang'e pámbeìdà àmbevamaihija vanu va apano pachilambo kuva nanga pavaelewije kuyamba masambi na haki yangu na hukumu yanga Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Vanang'o nanga pavaelewije kuyamba sambi ing'anya nanga pavangukulupila nangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>Na àmbevamaihija kuyamba haki yangu ing'anya ngùhwena kwanga Atata Nnungu, na mwenu nkambengwona kavila. <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Na àmbevamaihija kuva vànikosela kuyamba hukumu, ing'anya Nanchindenga, ntawala wa chilambo achino ànihukumiwa tayali.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>Nangu ngùvele na malove lohe lakunnyaulila mwenu, henga kwa vino nkambehulula kulapililila. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Henga pámbekamòlà aneyo Umumu wa uhiu, nang'e àmbennodya mwenu kupapata uhiu wammalele. Nang'e akambetangola kwa mamulaka lake mwene, henga àmbetangola chihi àlalá lámbepilikànà, nanang'e àmbentangila mwenu habali dya mambo lámbekwìdà. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Nang'e àmbengutumbyanga nangu kwa kunnyaulila mwenu malove àlalá lápwechedìlè kuhaloka kwang'une. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Vyammalele vyavele navyo Atata nni vyang'une, na njo mana ngùhawile kuva malove lambennyaulîla aneyo Umumu làhaloka kwang'une.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:15">Lihindambi lìmbepindikuka kuva ihangaladi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:15">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus with 6 disciples - CN01732" file="JesusWith6Disciples_CN01732.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="16:15"/> <verse eid="JHN 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila vakuhundwa vake kuchidoni, “Ùisalidile chihi uhiku kadiki nkambengwona, na bada ya uhiku kadiki muchimungwone kavila!” <verse eid="JHN 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Bahi vakuhundwa vake vanji nkutandilika kuujana kuva, “Àvele na mana ntwani patuhaulila kuva, ‘Ùisalidile chihi uhiku kadiki nkambengwona, na bada ya uhiku kadiki muchimungwone kavila?’ Na àvele na mana ntwani pahaula kuva, ‘Ngùhwena kwanga Atata Nnungu?’ ” <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Bahi nkuva uvaujana kavila kuchidoni, “Àvele na mana ntwani pahaula kuva, ‘uhiku kadiki?’ Tukámaite àyamba chamani.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Yesu ánimala kuva vachivammuje, bahi nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Dachi, mwenu mùujana kuyamba àlalá langútangwèlè kuva, ‘Ùisalidile chihi uhiku kadiki nkambengwona, na bada ya uhiku kadiki muchimungwone kavila?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, mwenu mùmbekuta na kulikutangila, henga vanu va chilambo achino vàmbehangalala. Na mwenu mùmbekuva nnihindambi, henga lihindambi lyenu lìmbepindikuka kuva ihangaladi. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Nkongwe pávà na uchungu wa kuveleka, àona kupwateka kwa kuva uhiku wake ùnihwika. Henga akàmmaleka mwana, akáhimukila kavila ipweteki yammalele ing'anya ya ihangaladi ya kuvelekwa kwa mwana pachilambo. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Na mwenu uchocho hambi mùnayuvala, henga nguchinimwonange kavila, na mùmbehangalala mmitima yenu, na ihangaladi yenu nanga munu ambemmusija. <verse eid="JHN 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>Na kutandikila nniduva anelyo nanga chinu chimumbenguuja. Nangu nìnnyaulilanga uhiu kuva, chinu chohecho chimumbennyuwa Atata Nnungu kwa lina lyangu, nang'e achiamwing'ange. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Mpaka hambi mukánambiyuwa chinu chohecho kwa lina lyangu. Mwenu yuwa chihi, na muchimupate, uchinga ihangaladi yenu itimilike.”<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nangu ǹnichilema chilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>“Nìnnyaulidile malove anelo kwa mifano. Henga uchiukamole uhiku unikambetangola na mwenu kavila kwa mifano, henga nìmbennyaulila chihi bila kumpiha chinu chohecho kunnyamba Atata Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Na kutandikila nniduva anelyo, mùmbeyuwa kwa lina lyangu, na nangu nikánnyaulila kuva nìmbennyuwa Atata Nnungu kwajili yenu mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Kwa kuva, Atata Nnungu mwene ànantamwanga mwenu. Ànantamwanga mwenu ing'anya mùngutamwije nangu na kukulupila kuva ngùhaleke kwa Nnungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Nangu ngùhaleke kwa Atata Nnungu, nkuida pachilambo, na hambi ngùchileka chilambo, ngùuya kwa Atata Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Vakuhundwa vake nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Enhee! Hambi ùhaula chihi mwandu wala nanga pautangola kwa mifano. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Hambi hwetu tùnimala kuva wako ùnimala kila chinu, na wala ukánnindilila munu akuuje chinu. Bahi ing'anya ya anelyo, tùnakulupila kuva ùhaleke kwa Nnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yesu nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Dachi, hambi mùnakulupila? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Uhiku ùvenkwida, na uhiku wene ùnikamola, uhiku anewo nni umumbemwadilihanywa, kila munu walihwenela kukaya kwake, na mwenu mùmbenguleka chihi weka. Henga nangu nikávele weka, kwa kuva Atata Nnungu àvele pamo na nangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Nangu nìnnyaulidile malove alano uchinga mùùve na amani kwa kulundanywa na nangu. Mwenu mùmbebanihwa apano pachilambo, henga likamyange mitima, kwa kuva nangu ǹnichilema chilambo.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu àvayuwila vakuhundwa vake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Yesu pamalidile kutangola malove anelo, nkulola muha kulihunde nkuchidoni, “Atata, hambi uhiku ùnikamola. Ntumbyange Mwanalo uchinga nanang'e akutumbyange wako. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Kwa kuva, ùmpele mamulaka pachanya pavanu vammalele, uchinga vanu vammalele vumpele aveng'e umi ukee na ntululilo. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Na umi ukee na ntululilo nni auno, vakumale wako Nnungu wa uhiu wa weka, na vammale na Yesu Kilisto untumîle. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Nangu ǹnikutumbyanga wako apano pachilambo, kwa kuva, madengo lungupele kulatenda ǹnilamalila. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Hambi Atata, ngutumbyange pameho pako, kwa aula ukulu unnavele nawo pannavele kwakuwe, kabla chilambo chikànambiumbwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>Nangu ǹnikumaiha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Munsitali auno Yohana àlembile, “ǹnilimaiha lina lyako.” Na vanu va chipindi achila válitambulanga lina kwa kumwamba munu mwene na mamulaka lake, bahi apano Yesu ámmaihije Nnungu mwene akee chihi lina.</char></note> kwa vanu vungupele namuna chuvele, vanu avala vuvatandwele kuhaloka pachilambo. Vanang'o vávele vanu vako, na wako nkuning'a vààve vangu, na vanang'o vànilakamula mahundo lako. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Na hambi vànimala kuva, vyammalele vyungupele vìhaloka kwakuwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Kwa kuva, malove lúngupèlè nìvapele vanang'o, na vànilapwechela na kumala kuva muhiu ngùhaleke kwakuwe na kukulupila kuva wako njo ungutumîle.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>Nangu nìvayuwila vanang'o. Wala nanga panguvayuwila vanu va chilambo, henga nìvayuwila avala vungupele, kwa kuva vanang'o nni vako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Vammalele vavêle vangu nni vako, na vavêle vako nni vangu, na nangu ǹnitumbyangwa kupitila vanang'o. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Nangu nikambeisalila chihi pachilambo, henga vanang'o vàvele upano pachilambo na nangu ngwìda kwakuwe. Atata Wanaswe, uvachunge mumamulaka la lina lyako lyungupele, uchinga vààve chinu chimo muchi hwetu chituvele chinu chimo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba lina lyako, lola Yohana 17:6.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Nangu ǹniva pamo na vanang'o, ǹnivachunga, nkuva salama mumamulaka la lina lyako lyungupele. Na wala nanga ayahîke, ikànave chihi ayula alembelêwa kuyahika, uchinga Malemba Lanaswe làtimile. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Henga hambi ngwìda kwakuwe, na ngulatangola malove alano akuno ngùvele upano pachilambo, uchinga mitima yavo iumbajwe na ihangaladi yangu. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Nangu nìvayanjajijije lilove lyako, na vanu va pachilambo vànivavenga kwa kuva, vanang'o nanga pavavele va pachilambo achino, malinga nangu chinikavele wa pachilambo achino. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Nangu nikákuyuwa uvause pachilambo, ila ngùyuwa uvachunge na Nanchindenga, Nkútenda lahakalenge. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Vanang'o nanga pavavele va pachilambo achino, malinga nangu chinikavele wa pachilambo achino. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Uvahahule vààve vanu vako kwa indila ya uhiu, na lilove lyako nni uhiu. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Malinga wako chungutumile pachilambo, nanani uchocho, nìvatuma vanang'o. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Nangu ngùlihumya nimwene kwakuwe kwajili ya vanang'o, uchinga na vanang'o vahahulwe kuva vanu vako kwa indila ya uhiu.”<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu àvayuwila vanu vammalele vambenkulupîla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>“Nangu nikávayuwila chihi vanang'o, henga nìvayuwila na vanu vammalele vambengukulupîla kupitila mahundo lavo. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Nangu mbènkuyuwa uchinga vammalele vààve chinu chimo malinga wako Atata chuve nkati mwangu na nangu chinguvele nkati mwako. Na vanang'o vààve nkati mwetu, uchinga vanu va pachilambo vakulupile kuva wako nni ungutumîle. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Aula ukulu ungupêle, nìvapele vanang'o, uchinga vààve chinu chimo malinga hwetu chituvele chinu chimo. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Nangu ngùùve nkati mwavo na wako ùùve nkati mwangu, uchinga vààve chinu chimo mwalehu, na vanu va pachilambo vamàle kuva wako njo ungutumîle, na vamale kuva ùnavatamwa malinga chungutamwa nangu.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>Atata, nangu ngùlembela avala vungupele vààve pamo na nangu pachinu panimbekuva, uchinga vawone ukulu wangu, aula úngupèlè, kwa kuva, úningutamwa ata kabla chilambo chikànambiumbwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Atata Umwene Haki, vanu va pachilambo nanga pavakumaite, henga nangu ǹnikumala, na avano vakuhundwa vànimala kuva wako njo ungutumîle. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Nangu ǹnikumaiha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba lina lyako, lola Yohana 17:6. </char></note> kwa avano vakuhundwa namuna chuvele, na nguchinguhwenehe kukumaiha, uchinga itamwi aila yungutamwije nangu ììve nkati mwavo na nangu ngùùve nkati mwavo.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Kutengelekwa kwanga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mako 14:43-50</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Bahi Yesu pamalidile kuyuwa, nkuuka pamo na vakuhundwa vake nkuyomboka Luhunde lwa Kediloni. M'bali wavili wa luhunde anelwo, kúvele na welu wa miseituni, bahi Yesu pamo na vakuhundwa vake nkuinjilanga anemwo mmwelu. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Na Yuda ayula antengelêke Yesu, ánipamala pachinu anepo kwa kuva myanda yohe Yesu ánakojana na vakuhundwa vake pachinu anepo. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Bahi Yuda nkulitwala likuwa lya matiyala va Chiloma na valinzi fulani vanatumwije na makuhani vakulu na Mafalisayo. Nkuhwena navo kuwelu akuno vanyakwìlè vibatali na myenje na vikomanilo. <figure style="fig" alt="Judas betrays Jesus in the garden" file="cn01812C.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="18:3"/><verse eid="JHN 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Akuno Yesu amaìtè lammalele lambempâta, nkulihumija muyo mwavo, nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Mùntaha nnani?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Vanang'o nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Yesu wa ku Nasaleti!” Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nangu nni Unene.” Na Yuda ayula nkútengeleka, áimidile pamo na vanang'o.<verse eid="JHN 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Bahi Yesu pavahaulidile kuva, “Nangu nni Unene,” vanang'o nkuuyang'ana nnyuma nkumatoka pahi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Yesu nkuvauja kavila kuchidoni, “Mùntaha nnani?” Nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Yesu wa ku Nasaleti!” <verse eid="JHN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nangu ǹninnyaulila kuva, ‘Nangu nni Unene.’ Na ikàva mùngutaha nangu, bahi valekange ava vahweneng'ane.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Yesu átangwele malove anelo uchinga làtimile malove àlalá lanatangwele kuva, “Avala vungupele nikanannyahite wala yumo.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Petulo ávele na upanga, nkuuhalamola, nkuncheketa likutu lya kunkono Mako, ntumwa wanga Kuhani Nkulu. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Bahi Yesu nkunnyaulila Petulo kuchidoni, “Ludisha upanga m'benda yake. Dachi, nangu nikálembelewa ngupitile ibaniki yangutayalishijije Atata Nnungu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu àpelekejwa kwanga Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Bahi alila likuwa lya matiyala va Chiloma na nkulu wavo na avala valinzi va Chiyahudi va Ing'ande ya Nnungu nkunkamula Yesu, nkunnyunga. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Nkutandilika kumpelekeja Yesu kwanga Anasi hoti, nkawake Kayafa, Kayafa ánavele Kuhani Nkulu mwaka anewo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Kayafa njo anavahaulidile Vayahudi kuva, wasa munu yumo ahwe kwajili ya vanu vammalele.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo ànkana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matayo 26:69-70</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mako 14:66-68</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Bahi Petulo pamo na nkuhundwa yunji, vanang'o nkunnondola Yesu. Aneyo nkuhundwa yunji kwa kuva ánamaikana kwanga Kuhani Nkulu, bahi nkuinjila pamo na Yesu nnuwani lwa lukumbi lwa Kuhani Nkulu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Henga Petulo áimidile chihi pawelu pepi na nnango. Ayula nkuhundwa yunji achimaikana kwanga Kuhani Nkulu, nkuhuma pawelu, nkutangola na mwali achilolihija pannango, nanang'e nkunnuhusu Petulo kwenda nkati. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Bahi ayula mwali nkummuja Petulo kuchidoni, “Kwani na wako ukee yumo wa avala vakuhundwa va ayula munu?” Petulo nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Wala nikee nangu!”<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Bahi kwa kuva pávele na imepo, vatumishi na valinzi nkukumbanya moto uchinga vayote. Petulo nanang'e áimidile pamo na vanang'o wayota moto.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:18">Anasi àmmuja Yesu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:18">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mako 14:55-64</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:18">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus' trial before priests - CN01815" file="Jesus'TrialBeforePriests_CN01815.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="18:18"/> <verse eid="JHN 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Bahi Anasi, ánavele Kuhani Nkulu anepo machedo, nkummuja Yesu kwamba vakuhundwa vake pamo na mahundo lake. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Maduva lammalele, nangu ngútangola na kila munu bila kulipiha, na myanda yohe ngúhunda n'ding'ande dya kunnyuwila Nnungu na nnuwani lwa Ing'ande ya Nnungu, pachinu pavakojana Vayahudi vammalele. Na wala nanga chinu chingutangwele kwa sili. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Ing'anya ntwani ùnguuja nangu? Kavauje avala vapilikene lanichitangola, vanang'o vànimala sana àlalá lanichitangola.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Bahi Yesu pamalidile kutangola malove anelo, nlinzi yumo anaimidile apala nkumpanyaula Yesu likofi, wahaula kuchidoni, “Mwadachi wako ùnnyang'ula uchocho Kuhani Nkulu?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Ikàva ǹnihakajanga kutangola, bahi shuhudila anelo laǹguhakajîje. Henga ikàva ngùtangwele lambone, mwadachi unangupanya?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Bahi Anasi nkumpelekeja Yesu kwanga Kayafa, Kuhani Nkulu, akuno ahungwìjè.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:24">Petulo ànkana Yesu kavila</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:24">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matayo 26:71-75</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mako 14:69-72</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:24">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Peter denies knowing Jesus 2nd time - CN01819" file="PeterDeniesKnowingJesus(2ndTime)_CN01819.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="18:24"/> <verse eid="JHN 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Uhiku anewo Petulo áimidile chihi upala wayota moto. Bahi vanu vanji vánavele anepo nkummuja kuchidoni, “Kwani na wako ukee yumo wa vakuhundwa vake?” Nang'e nkukana wachidoni, “Wala nikee nangu!” <verse eid="JHN 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Ntumwa yumo wa Kuhani Nkulu, nnung'une ayula ánacheketwe likutu na Petulo, nkummuja Petulo kuchidoni, “Kwani nangu nikanakuwene wako akula kuwelu ùvele pamo na Yesu?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Bahi Petulo nkukana kavila, upopo ung'uku nkukongovela.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu muyo mwanga Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 11:-1-31">11-31</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:1-20">Mako 15:1-20</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 13:-1-25">13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Bahi ulyamba na mambumbu Vayahudi nkuntwala Yesu kwanga Kayafa nkumpelekeja kuing'ande ya Pilato, nkulu wa Chiloma wa chilambo achila. Henga Vayahudi vene nanga pavanainjidile nng'ande ya chifalume ing'anya ya sheliya dya Chiyahudi, kwa kuva vakàchiingila anemwo vakanivalangiwa kuva najisi ing'anya ya kuinjila nng'ande mwa munu akávele Nnyahudi na vakanaluhusiwe kuchilya chakulya cha Sikukuu ya Pasaka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Pasaka, lola Yohana 2:13.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Bahi Pilato ayula nkulu wa Chiloma, nkuvahwenela upala pawelu nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Mùvele na mashitaka ntwani kunnyamba ayu munu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Vanang'o nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Ayu munu kwikavele akàtenda lahakalenge, hwetu tukanankamuje kwakuwe.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilato nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Ntwale mmene mukánnyukumu kupapatana na sheliya yenu.” Vayahudi nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Hwetu tukee na mamulaka la kummwalala munu woheyo.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Anelo lánitendeka uchinga latimile malove lánatangwele Yesu kwamba namuna chambekuhwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:32">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus' trial before Pilate - WA03921" file="Jesus'TrialBeforePilate_WA03921.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="18:32"/> <verse eid="JHN 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Bahi Pilato nkuinjila kavila nnuwani lwa nkati lwa ing'ande ya chifalume, nkunchema Yesu nkummuja kuchidoni, “Ati wako nni Nfalume wa Vayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Malove anelo ùtangola umwene au ànipwawa munu akuhaulidile habali dyangu?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilato nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Kwani nangu Nnyahudi? Vanu vako na makuhani vakulu njo vakupelekejîje kwang'une. Kwani ùtendilechi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Ufalume wangu ukee wa apano pachilambo. Ufalume wangu ukàchiva wa apano pachilambo, valinzi vangu vakaningupanyanila uchinga Vayahudi vanangukamule. Henga hambi, Ufalume wangu ukee wa apano pachilambo.” <verse eid="JHN 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Bahi Pilato nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Dachi, wamba wako nfalume?” Yesu nkuyang'ula kuchidoni, “Wako ùnihaula kuva nangu nfalume. Nangu ǹnivelekwa na ngùidile pachilambo uchinga nivashuhudile vanu kwamba uhiu. Na kila munu autâmwa uhiu ànangupilikanila.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilato nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Uhiu njo chamani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilato pamalidile kutangola malove anelo, nkuvahwenela kavila Vayahudi pawelu, nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nangu nikályona likosa lya kunnyukumu munu ayu. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Henga mwenu mùvele na nnyambo wakuchimuliwa nfungwa yumo mahiku la Sikukuu ya Pasaka. Dachi, mùnalembela ninchimulile Nfalume wa Vayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Anepo nkutayanga lwasu uvachidoni, “Tukántamwa munu aneyo! Hwetu tùlembela utuchimulile Balaba!” Na aneyo Balaba ávele muasi achilinga kuutahuka utawala wa Chiloma.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu àhukumiwa kuhwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Soldiers mocking Jesus - GT00086" file="SoldiersMockingJesus(CrownOfThorns)_Luke22.63-65_GT00086.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="19:0"/> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Bahi Pilato nkuvaamulisa matiyala vantwale Yesu na kunsulubula. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Kwa mang'wanyu, matiyala nkudinga lutavi lwa miva malinga kofiya ya chifalume, nkummwaja mmuti. Nkummwaja na likoti lya langi ya chifalume. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Nkuva uvahwena muyo mwake uvachidoni, “Utumbyangwe, Nfalume wa Vayahudi,” akuno uvampanya makofi. <verse eid="JHN 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilato nkuhuma kavila pawelu nkuvahaulila Vayahudi kuchidoni, “Lola, nangu nìmbeida nawe pawelu, uchinga mumale kuva nangu nikályona likosa lya kunnyukumu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Bahi Yesu nkuhuma pawelu, akuno awètè kofiya ya miva na alila likoti lya langi ya chifalume. Pilato nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Munu wene nni ayuno!” <verse eid="JHN 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Bahi makuhani vakulu na valinzi va Ing'ande yanga Nnungu pavammwene Yesu, nkutaya lwasu uvachidoni, “Mmambe munsalaba! Mmambe munsalaba!” Pilato nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Ntwalange mmene mukammambe, kwa kuva nangu nikályona likosa lya kunnyukumu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Vayahudi nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Hwetu tùvele na sheliya yetu, na kupapatana na sheliya aneyo, ayu munu àlembelewa kuhwa, kwa kuva álichemile Mwana wanga Nnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Pilato papilikene malove anelo, nkuhalija kuyopa. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Pilato nkuinjila kavila nnuwani lwa nkati lwa ing'ande ya chifalume, nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Kwani wako kwenu kwachi?” Henga Yesu nkunyalala chihi. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Bahi Pilato nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Dachi, ukátamwa kutangola na nangu? Dachi, wako ukámaite kuva nangu ngùvele na mamulaka la kukuhungula au kukuvamba munsala?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Wako ukee na mamulaka lohelo kwang'une, ikànave chihi àlalá lakupêle Nnungu. Bahi ing'anya ya anelyo, ayula angukamujîje kwakuwe àtendile sambi ing'ulu namene kupunda yakuwe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Bahi kutandikila anepo, Pilato nkuva wataha indila ya kunnyungula Yesu. Henga Vayahudi nkutaya lwasu, uvachidoni, “Ukànnyungula munu ayu, wako ukákumilana na Nfalume wa Loma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nsitali auno ùlembwije Kaisali, kuyamba lina lya cheo cha Nfalume nkulu wa Loma.</char></note>. Kwa kuva, kila munu alitênda kuva nfalume, àntahuka Nfalume wa Loma!” <verse eid="JHN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Pilato papilikene malove anelo nkunnyumya kavila Yesu pawelu, nkuikala pachiteng'u chake cha hukumu, pachinu pachêmwa, “Sakafu ya Mayanga,” na Vaeblaniya vàchema, “Gabata.”<verse eid="JHN 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Yávele malinga sasita muhi, nniduva lya kulipanganiha kwajili ya Sikukuu ya Vayahudi ichêmwa Pasaka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Pasaka, lola Yohana 2:13.</char></note> Pilato nkuvahaulila Vayahudi kuchidoni, “Nnolange nfalume wenu!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Henga vanang'o nkutayanga lwasu uvachidoni, “Mmwalale! Mmwalale! Mmambe munsalaba!” Pilato nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Dachi, mùlembela nimmambe nfalume wenu?” Makuhani vakulu nkuyang'ula kuchidoni, “Hwetu tukávele na nfalume yunji ikànave chihi Nfalume wa Loma.” <verse eid="JHN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Bahi Pilato nkuvakamuja Yesu, uchinga vakammambe munsalaba, anepo matiyala nkuntwala Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu àvambwa munsalaba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mako 15:21-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Three Crosses - GT00087" file="ThreeCrosses_Luke23.33_GT00087.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="19:16"/> <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Yesu nkuuka paimanga akuno anyakwìlè nsalaba wake mpaka pachinu pachêmwa, “Pachinu pa Libadang'a,” kwa Chieblaniya pàchemwa, “Goligota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Matiyala nkummamba Yesu munsalaba. Nkuvambwa na vanu vanji vavili, yumo m'bali wake wa kunkono na yunji m'bali wa kunchinda, na Yesu paching'ati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilato nkulaija lalembwe malove koka lavikwe munsalaba. Anelo malove lálembwije uvila, “YESU WA NASALETI, NFALUME WA VAYAHUDI.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Bahi Vayahudi vohe vánilasoma malove anelo kwa kuva, pachinu apala panavambwije Yesu pávele pepi na imanga na malove anelo lálembwije kwa Chieblaniya na Chilatini na Chigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Bahi makuhani vakulu va Vayahudi nkunnyaulila Pilato kuchidoni, “Unalembe, ‘Nfalume wa Vayahudi,’ ila lemba uvila, ‘Ayuno munu áhawile kuva, nangu njo Nfalume wa Vayahudi!’ ” <verse eid="JHN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilato nkuyang'ula kuchidoni, “Langulembile, ǹnilalemba!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Matiyala pavamalidile kummamba Yesu, nkuditwala dinguwo dyake, nkuyavanya matunji ncheche, kila litiyala litunji lyake. Nkupatana vanaipapule kanzu yake kwa kuva ikánavele na pachinu patotwîje ila ífumwije chihi kutandikila muha mpaka pahi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Avala matiyala nkuhaulanila kuchidoni, “Tunaipapule kanzu aino, henga tuyele indingi uchinga tumale kuva ìmbekuva yanga nnani.” Anelo lánitendeka uchinga latimile Malemba Lanaswe lahaûla kuva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Vániyavana dinguwo dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">na inguwo yangu nkuiyelela indingi.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Bahi anelo njo lavanatendile anevo matiyala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Mary John &amp; Women at cross - CN01840" file="MaryJohn&amp;WomenAtCross_John19.25-27_CN01840.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="19:24"/> <verse eid="JHN 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Pepi na nsalaba wanga Yesu áimidile anyokwe Yesu, na anyokwe nkulu na Maliya n'jawe Kileopa na Maliya wa imanga ya ku Magidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Bahi Yesu pammwene anyokwe aimidìlè pepi na ayula nkuhundwa wanantamwije namene Yesu, nkunnyaulila anyokwe kuchidoni, “Mama! Aneyo vino njo mwanalo.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Anepo nkunnyaulila ayula nkuhundwa kuchidoni, “Aneyo vino njo anyoko.” Na kutandikila liduva anelyo, ayula nkuhundwa nkuntwala Maliya, nkunaikala nawe kukaya kwake.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhwa kwanga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mako 15:33-41</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Bada ya anelo, akuno Yesu wamala kuva lammalele lànitimila na uchinga Malemba Lanaswe latimile, nkuchidoni, “Ngùvele na inyota.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabuli 69:21.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Pachinu anepo pávele na chombo chínavele na divayi dihahâma. Bahi matiyala nkuchuvika siponji n'divayi adila, nkupatika nnufito lwa nnandi wa hisopo, nkummika Yesu pakanya pake uchinga ahonde. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yesu pamidile adila divayi nkuchidoni, “Lammalele lànitimila!” Anepo nkutepya muti wake, nkuhila.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu àhomekwa nkuchi nnuvau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Liduva alila lívele lya kulipanganiha kwajili ya Liduva lya Kuyewelela, na liduva anelyo lya Kuyewelela lívele likulu kwa kuva lívele liduva lya Sikukuu ya Vayahudi ya Pasaka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maeleso layâmba Pasaka, lola Yohana 2:13.</char></note> Ing'anya ya anelyo, Vayahudi vakanalembedile miili ya avala vavambwîje mmisalaba iisalile chihi umula muha. Bahi nkunnyuwa Pilato avaluhùsù kuvalumula madodo vanu avala vanavambwîje mmisalaba uchinga vapiyanye kuhwa na miili yavo iuswe. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Bahi matiyala nkuhwena unalumula madodo la avala vanu vanavambwîjwe pamo na Yesu munsalaba, nkunnumula ntandi na wavili. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Henga pavakamwele kwanga Yesu nkunkoja ahidìlè, bahi nanga pavanannumwile madodo. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Henga litiyala yumo nkunnyoma nkuchi nnuvau, upala nkuhuma myadi na medi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Munu alawêne mambo anelo nni ahûmya ushahidi, na ushahidi wake nni wauhiu. Na animâla kuva àtangola uhiu, uchinga na mwenu mupate kukulupila. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Alano lánitendeka uchinga latimile Malemba Lanaswe lahaûla kuva, “Wala nanga liwangwa lyake limo limbelumûlwa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuuka 12:46, Isabu 9:12, Sabuli 34:20.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Na Malemba Lanaswe lanji làhaula kuva, “Vàmbennola ayula uvannyomile nkuchi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sakaliya 12:10.</char></note> <figure style="fig" alt="Water &amp; Blood - GT00102" file="Water&amp;Blood_John19.34_GT00102.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="19:37"/><verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusikwa kwanga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mako 15:42-47</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Anepo Yusufu mwenedi wa ku Alimataya, nkunnyuwa Pilato luhusa lwa kuusa mmili wanga Yesu. Na aneyo Yusufu ávele nkuhundwa wa sili wanga Yesu, ing'anya ávayopa vakulu va Vayahudi. Bahi Pilato nkunnuusu, na Yusufu nkuhwena unauusa mmili wanga Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Nikodemo, ayula anamwenedile Yesu nachilo nanang'e ániida. Nang'e ányakwile malinga kilo salasini dya mahuta la manemane lakundanyike na ubani. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Bahi vammalele vavili nkuutwala mmili wanga Yesu, nkuudingilija sanda ivapakile mahuta lakunung'ila. Vátendile uchocho kupapatana na mihambo ya Vayahudi ya kuuandaa mmili kwajili ya kuusika. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Pepi na pachinu apala pávambwije Yesu, pávele na welu, na mmwelu anewo múvele na nsati wahambi, uvakanambi kunsika munu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Na kwa kuva lívele liduva lya kulipanganiha kwajili ya Liduva lya Kuyewelela lya Vayahudi, na kwa kuva nsati úvele pepi, bahi nkunansika Yesu anemwo. <figure style="fig" alt="Tomb being closed after Jesus burial - WA03928" file="TombBeingClosedAfterJesus'Burial_WA03928.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="19:42"/><verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Nsati ukávele chinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mako 16:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Peter &amp; John in tomb - CN01852" file="Peter&amp;JohnInTomb_CN01852.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="20:0"/> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Liduva lya Jumapili, ulyamba na mambumbu akuno kuvèlè na lupi, Maliya wa imanga ya Magidala ápite kunsati, aneko nkulyona liyanga livanadivite pannango wa nsati liuswije. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Bahi nkutukuta nkuhwena kwanga Petulo na kwanga ayula nkuhundwa yunji wanantamwijwe namene na Yesu, nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nang'olo vànimmusa munsati na wala nanga patumaite kuvammikile.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Bahi Petulo pamo na ayula nkuhundwa yunji nkuuka nkuhwena kunsati. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Vammalele vavili nkutukuta, henga ayula nkuhundwa yunji nkutukuta namene kumpunda Petulo, nkulongolela kuhwika pansati. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Pakamwele, nkutepa nkupenekela nkati munsati, nkuyona sanda, henga nanga panainjidile. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Anepo Petulo nkukamola pachikundu pake, nkuinjila mwalehu munsati. Nkuyona sanda ìvele panyenje, <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>pamo na chitambala chivanavimbile mmuti wanga Yesu. Anecho chitambala nanga pachinavikwije pamo na vinji, ila chínipindanywa na kuvikwa pachinu panji paweka. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Bahi ayula nkuhundwa yunji analongoledile kukamola pansati nanang'e nkuinjila nkati. Nkulilolela mwene, nkukulupila. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Kwa kuva, vávele bado vakànambikwelewa àlalá Malemba Lanaswe lahaûla kuva, lasima Yesu afufuke kuhaloka kwa vahwîle. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Bahi anevo vakuhundwa nkuuka, nkuuya kukaya.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ànhumila Maliya wa ku Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28:9-10</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mako 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Henga Maliya wa imanga ya ku Magidala áimidile pawelu nsati wakuta. Pánavele nkukuta, nkutepa kupenekela munsati, <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>nkuvona malaika vavili vanawete dinguwo dyanahe, vaikalèngè apala paunalajijwe mmili wanga Yesu, yumo m'bali wa kumuti na yunji m'bali wa kumadodo. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Anevo malaika nkummuja Maliya kuchidoni, “Mama, ùkuta chani?” Nang'e nkuvayang'ula kuchidoni, “Nakuta ing'anya vànimmusa Nang'olo wangu na nangu nikámaite pachinu pavammikile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Mary Magdalene &amp; Jesus - CN01857" file="MaryMagdalene&amp;Jesus_John20.16-17_CN01857.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="20:13"/> <verse eid="JHN 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Pamalidile kutangola malove anelo, nkulauka kunyuma, nkumwona Yesu aimidìlè, henga nanga panammaite kuva nni Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yesu nkummuja kuchidoni, “Mama, mwadachi unakùtà? Ùntaha nnani?” Maliya nkutenda kuva walonjela nawe nni nkúlima wa aula welu, bahi nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, ikàva wako njo ummusîje, ngùhaulile kuummikile, nguhwene nikantwale.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Maliya!” Maliya nkulauka, nkutangola kwa Chieblaniya, kuchidoni, “Laboni!” Mana lake, Nkúhunda. <verse eid="JHN 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Unangukamule, kwa kuva nikanahwena kwa Atatangu. Henga hwena kwa anung'unuvangu ukavahaulile kuchidoni, ‘Ngùhwena muha kwa Atatangu, nanang'e nni Atatawenu, Nnungu wangu na nni Nnungu wenu.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Bahi Maliya wa imanga ya ku Magidala nkuhwena unavahaulila vakuhundwa vanga Yesu wachidoni, “Ǹnimwona Nang'olo!” Na nkuvahaulila lammalele lannyaulidile Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu àvahumila vakuhundwa vake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako 16:14-18</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Yávele chinalyulo cha liduva ulila lya Jumapili, vakuhundwa Yesu vávele pamo nng'ande na milango ínichimwa ing'anya vávayopa vakulu va Vayahudi. Bahi upala Yesu nkuvahumila, nkuimila paching'ati, nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Amani ììve pamo na mwenu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Patangwele malove anelo, nkuvalanguja makono lake na nnuvau. Bahi anevo vakuhundwa nkuhangalala namene pavammwene Nang'olo. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kavila kuchidoni, “Amani ììve pamo na mwenu! Malinga Atata Nnungu changutumile nangu, nanangu uchocho nìntuma mwenu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Pamalidile kutangola malove anelo, nkuvavehija dimumu, nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Mpwechelange Umumu Wanaswe. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Munu woheyo umumbensamehe masambi lake, achiasamehewe, na munu woheyo umukambensamehe masambi lake, akambesamehewa.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 20:23">Yesu ànnyumila Tomaso</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:23">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Thomas &amp; Jesus wounds in hands - WA03933" file="Thomas&amp;Jesus(WoundsInHands)_John20.28-29_WA03933.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="20:23"/> <verse eid="JHN 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Henga Tomaso, uvanchema Didimasi, mana lake nnyapule, nkuhundwa yumo muavala kumi na mbili, akánavele pamo na avake panaidile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Bahi avala vakuhundwa vanji nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Tùnimwona Nang'olo.” Tomaso nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nikànadyone alama dya misumali mmakono lake na kutaya chala changu n'dyalama anedyo na kutaya nkono wangu nnuvau lwake, mwiko nikambekulupila kuva mùnimwona.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Bahi nniduva lya nane, vakuhundwa vanga Yesu vávele kavila pamo nng'ande, Tomaso nanang'e ávele pamo na vanang'o. Bahi Yesu nkuvaidila, akuno milango ichimìjwè, nkuimila paching'ati, nkuhaula kuchidoni, “Amani ììve pamo na mwenu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Anepo nkunnyaulila Tomaso kuchidoni, “Vika chala chako apano, na ulalole makono langu, na unyoloje nkono wako uutaye nnuvau lwangu. Unave umunu ukákulupila, henga kulupila.” <verse eid="JHN 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tomaso nkunnyaulila Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo wangu na Nnungu wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Wako ùnikulupila kwa kuva ùningwona, henga wasa avala vakulupîla bila ungwona.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chinu chin'tendile Yohana alembe chitabu achino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yesu átendile vimaiho vya masaibu vinji vyohe muyo mwa vakuhundwa vake vikálembwijwe nchitabu chino. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Henga alano lànilembwa uchinga mupate kukulupila kuva Yesu njo Kilisto, Mwana wanga Nnungu, na kwa kukulupila mupate umi kwa kulundana nawe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Apano Yohana àlembile “mulina lyake,” na mmahiku anelo vanu vàtumila malove “lina lyake” kumwamba munu mwene. Bahi kuva mulina lyake ìvele na mana kuva, wako unilundana nawe. Maeleso layâmba lina, lola Yohana 1:12.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu àvahumila vakuhundwa vake saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Bahi palapitile anelo, Yesu nkuvahumila kavila vakuhundwa vake kunyenje Litanda lya Tibeliya, yani Litanda lya Galilaya. Kuvahumila kwake kwávele uvila, <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>liduva limo, Petulo na Tomaso uvanchema Didimasi, mana lake nnyapule, na Nasanieli mwenedi wa Kana ya chilambo cha ku Galilaya na vana vavili va Sebedayo pamo na vakuhundwa vanji vavili, vávelenge pamo. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Petulo nkuvahaulila avake kuchidoni, “Nangu ngùhwena unaupa dihomba.” Vanang'o nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Na hwetu tùmbelongana na wako.” Bahi nkukananga, nkunakwelanga ingalava, henga chilo anecho nanga pavanapete chinu chohecho. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Na uhiku pauchicha, Yesu nkuimila nnyenje litanda, henga vakuhundwa nanga pavachimmala kama nni nang'e. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Bahi Yesu nkuvauja kuchidoni, “Mmanavangu, dachi mùnipata dihomba?” Vanang'o nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Waala.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Tayanga dinjawu m'bali wa kunkono wa ingalava na muchimupate dihomba.” Bahi nkuyahanga dinjawu, nachihambi nkupata dihomba dyohe namene mpaka nkuvalema kuutangila nkati ingalava, adila dinjawu díumbele dihomba. <figure style="fig" alt="Disciples hauling fish into boat - CN01875" file="DisciplesHaulingFishIntoBoat_CN01875.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="21:6"/><verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Anepo ayula nkuhundwa wanantamwije namene Yesu nkunnyaulila Petulo kuchidoni, “Ayu nni Nang'olo!” Bahi Petulo papilikene kuva nni Nang'olo, nkuwala inguwo yake ya pannima kwa kuva nanga panaiwete, nkuliyela mmedi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Na avala vakuhundwa vanji nkuva uvaida kunnyangi na ingalava, akuno uvautanga lwau luombêle dihomba, kwa kuva nanga pávanavele kulehu na kunnyangi ila vávele chihi malinga mita myamoja uvila. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Na pavahwikile kunnyangi, nkuwona nkate na uhomba ayanikwîje pamakala la moto. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus serving breakfast - LB00330" file="JesusServingBreakfast_John21.9_LB00330.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="21:9"/><verse eid="JHN 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Idanadyo apano dihomba dinji dimuupile.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Bahi Petulo nkuinjila muingalava, nkuutangila kunnyangi lwau alula luombêle dihomba ding'ulungwa myamoja amsini na tatu. Pamo na dihomba kuva dyohe, henga lwau nanga palunakadwike. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yesu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Idang'ana mulye.” Na wala nanga nkuhundwa analingile umuja kuva, “Wako nnani?” Kwa kuva, vánimala kuva nni Nang'olo. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Yesu nkwida, nkutwala nkate, nkuveng'a, nkutenda uchocho na adila dihomba.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Auno wávele mwanda watatu Yesu kuvahumila vakuhundwa vake bada ya kufufuka.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 21:14">Yesu nawi Petulo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:14">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus talking to peter - CN01880" file="JesusTalkingToPeter_John21.15_CN01880.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="21:14"/> <verse eid="JHN 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Bahi pavamalidile kulya, Yesu nkummuja Petulo kuchidoni, “Petulo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:15-17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mmalemba ilembwijwe Simoni, lina lyake linji Petulo</char></note> mwana wanga Yohana! Dachi, muhiu ùnangutamwa kupunda ava?” Nang'e nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Elo, Nang'olo, wako ùnimala kuva nangu nakutamwa.” Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Valise vanu vangu unguvalandenye na angandolo.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Nkumuja kavila mwanda wavili kuchidoni, “Petulo, mwana wanga Yohana, dachi ùnangutamwa?” Petulo nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Elo, Nang'olo, wako ùnimala kuva nangu nakutamwa.” Yesu nkunnyaulila kavila kuchidoni, “Vachunge vanu vangu unguvalandenye na angandolo.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Anepo Yesu nkummuja mwanda watatu kuchidoni, “Petulo mwana wanga Yohana, dachi ùnangutamwa?” Bahi Petulo nkutandilika kuyuvala ing'anya áujijwe mwanda watatu kuva, “Dachi, ùnangutamwa?” Petulo nkunnyang'ula Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, wako ùnimala lammalele, na ùnimala kuva nangu nakutamwa.” Yesu nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Valise vanu vangu unguvalandenye na angandolo vangu! <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Nangu nìkuhaulila uhiu kuva, púnavele kijana úliwaja chihi umwene na kuhwena chihi kwoheko kulembela. Henga paumbekongopala ùmbenyoloja chihi makono lako, na munu yunji akuwaje na kukupelekeja pachinu pukatamwa.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Yesu átangwele malove anelo ùlanguja namuna Petulo chambekuhwa na kuntumbyanga Nnungu. Pámalidile kutangola uchocho, Yesu nkunnyaulila Petulo kuchidoni, “Ngupapate.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nawi Yohana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Anepo Petulo nkulauka, nkumwona ayula nkuhundwa atamwîjwe namene na Yesu wavalandola. Nkuhundwa aneyo nni ayula anayamene na Yesu pavachilya chakulya cha lyulo, na nkummuja kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, nnani ambekutengelêka?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Bahi Petulo pammwene aneyo nkuhundwa, nkummuja Yesu kuchidoni, “Nang'olo, na ayu dachi?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yesu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Ikàva ngùlembela ààve chihi mumi mpaka panimbeida kavila yakuwe ilida? Wako ngupapate chihi nangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Bahi aila habali nkupilikanika kwa vakúlupila vanji va Yesu kuva ayula nkuhundwa nanga pambekuhwa. Henga Yesu nanga panahawile kuva aneyo nkuhundwa nanga pambekuhwa, ila áhawile kuva, “Ikàva ngùlembela ààve chihi mumi mpaka panimbeida kavila yakuwe ilida?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Nkuhundwa aneyo njo ayula ahûmya ushahidi wa mambo alano, na nni uyoyo alembîle habali adino. Na hwetu tùnimala kuva ushahidi wake nni muhiu.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ntululilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Na pàvele na mambo lanji lohe lalatendîle Yesu. Henga kwikavele uchilembwa kila chinu chachitendile Yesu, ngwòna ata chilambo chammalele chikánaoneleje kuvika vitabu vichichivilembwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
